{"surah": 26, "verses": [{"ayah": 1, "text": "طسٓمٓ ", "translation": "Ṭā, Seen, Meem.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "طسٓمٓ", "translit": "ٓmٓsṭ", "root": ""}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 2, "text": "تِلْكَ ءَايَٰتُ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ ٱلْمُبِينِ ", "translation": "These are the verses of the clear Book.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "تِلْكَ", "translit": "َkْlِt", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ءَايَٰتُ", "translit": "ُtَٰyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمُبِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِbُmْlٱ", "root": "بين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 3, "text": "لَعَلَّكَ بَٰخِعٌ نَّفْسَكَ أَلَّا يَكُونُوا۟ مُؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Perhaps, [O Muḥammad], you would kill yourself with grief that they will not be believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "لَعَلَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّlَʿعَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بَٰخِعٌ", "translit": "ٌʿعِhkَٰb", "root": "بخع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نَّفْسَكَ", "translit": "َkَsْfَّn", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَلَّا", "translit": "āَّlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَكُونُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnwُkَy", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مُؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 4, "text": "إِن نَّشَأْ نُنَزِّلْ عَلَيْهِم مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ ءَايَةً فَظَلَّتْ أَعْنَٰقُهُمْ لَهَا خَٰضِعِينَ ", "translation": "If We willed, We could send down to them from the sky a sign for which their necks would remain humbled.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَّشَأْ", "translit": "ْaʾَhsَّn", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نُنَزِّلْ", "translit": "ْlِّzَnُn", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِم", "translit": "mِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَmَّslٱ", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "فَظَلَّتْ", "translit": "ْtَّlَẓَf", "root": "ظلل"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَعْنَٰقُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُqَٰnْʿعَaʾ", "root": "عنق"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "لَهَا", "translit": "āَhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "خَٰضِعِينَ", "translit": "َnyِʿعِḍَٰhk", "root": "خضع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 5, "text": "وَمَا يَأْتِيهِم مِّن ذِكْرٍ مِّنَ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ مُحْدَثٍ إِلَّا كَانُوا۟ عَنْهُ مُعْرِضِينَ ", "translation": "And no mention [i.e., revelation] comes to them anew from the Most Merciful except that they turn away from it.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَأْتِيهِم", "translit": "mِhyِtْaʾَy", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ذِكْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْkِhd", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ", "translit": "ِnَٰmْḥَّrlٱ", "root": "رحم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مُحْدَثٍ", "translit": "ٍhtَdْḥُm", "root": "حدث"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "كَانُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عَنْهُ", "translit": "ُhْnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "مُعْرِضِينَ", "translit": "َnyِḍِrْʿعُm", "root": "عرض"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 6, "text": "فَقَدْ كَذَّبُوا۟ فَسَيَأْتِيهِمْ أَنۢبَٰٓؤُا۟ مَا كَانُوا۟ بِهِۦ يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ ", "translation": "For they have already denied, but there will come to them the news of that which they used to ridicule.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَقَدْ", "translit": "ْdَqَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "كَذَّبُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُbَّhdَk", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَسَيَأْتِيهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhyِtْaʾَyَsَf", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَنۢبَٰٓؤُا۟", "translit": "۟āُwʾَٰٓbۢnَaʾ", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كَانُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ", "translit": "َnwُءِzْhَtْsَy", "root": "هزا"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 7, "text": "أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ إِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ كَمْ أَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا مِن كُلِّ زَوْجٍ كَرِيمٍ ", "translation": "Did they not look at the earth - how much We have produced therein from every noble kind?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَوَلَمْ", "translit": "ْmَlَwَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَرَوْا۟", "translit": "۟āْwَrَy", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَى", "translit": "àَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْrَaʾْlٱ", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كَمْ", "translit": "ْmَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَنۢبَتْنَا", "translit": "āَnْtَbۢnَaʾ", "root": "نبت"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فِيهَا", "translit": "āَhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "كُلِّ", "translit": "ِّlُk", "root": "كلل"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "زَوْجٍ", "translit": "ٍjgْwَz", "root": "زوج"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "كَرِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِrَk", "root": "كرم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 8, "text": "إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَءَايَةًۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكْثَرُهُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَءَl", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَكْثَرُهُم", "translit": "mُhُrَhtْkَaʾ", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُّm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 9, "text": "وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ ", "translation": "And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translit": "ُzyِzَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِḥَّrlٱ", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 10, "text": "وَإِذْ نَادَىٰ رَبُّكَ مُوسَىٰٓ أَنِ ٱئْتِ ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ ", "translation": "And [mention] when your Lord called Moses, [saying], \"Go to the wrongdoing people -", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَادَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَdāَn", "root": "ندي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَبُّكَ", "translit": "َkُّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مُوسَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَنِ", "translit": "ِnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱئْتِ", "translit": "ِtْyʾٱ", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْقَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَqْlٱ", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmِlَّٰẓlٱ", "root": "ظلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 11, "text": "قَوْمَ فِرْعَوْنَۚ أَلَا يَتَّقُونَ ", "translation": "The people of Pharaoh. Will they not fear Allāh?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "translit": "َnْwَʿعْrِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَلَا", "translit": "āَlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَتَّقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqَّtَy", "root": "وقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 12, "text": "قَالَ رَبِّ إِنِّىٓ أَخَافُ أَن يُكَذِّبُونِ ", "translation": "He said, \"My Lord, indeed I fear that they will deny me", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِنِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَخَافُ", "translit": "ُfāَhkَaʾ", "root": "خوف"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يُكَذِّبُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُbِّhdَkُy", "root": "كذب"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 13, "text": "وَيَضِيقُ صَدْرِى وَلَا يَنطَلِقُ لِسَانِى فَأَرْسِلْ إِلَىٰ هَٰرُونَ ", "translation": "And that my breast will tighten and my tongue will not be fluent, so send for Aaron.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَيَضِيقُ", "translit": "ُqyِḍَyَw", "root": "ضيق"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "صَدْرِى", "translit": "àِrْdَṣ", "root": "صدر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَنطَلِقُ", "translit": "ُqِlَṭnَy", "root": "طلق"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لِسَانِى", "translit": "àِnāَsِl", "root": "لسن"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فَأَرْسِلْ", "translit": "ْlِsْrَaʾَf", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "هَٰرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrَٰh", "root": ""}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 14, "text": "وَلَهُمْ عَلَىَّ ذَنۢبٌ فَأَخَافُ أَن يَقْتُلُونِ ", "translation": "And they have upon me a [claim due to] sin, so I fear that they will kill me.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَىَّ", "translit": "َّàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ذَنۢبٌ", "translit": "ٌbۢnَhd", "root": "ذنب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَأَخَافُ", "translit": "ُfāَhkَaʾَf", "root": "خوف"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يَقْتُلُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُlُtْqَy", "root": "قتل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 15, "text": "قَالَ كَلَّاۖ فَٱذْهَبَا بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآۖ إِنَّا مَعَكُم مُّسْتَمِعُونَ ", "translation": "[Allāh] said, \"No. Go both of you with Our signs; indeed, We are with you, listening.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "كَلَّا", "translit": "āَّlَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَٱذْهَبَا", "translit": "āَbَhْhdٱَf", "root": "ذهب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآ", "translit": "ٓāَnِtَٰyāَٔـِb", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِنَّا", "translit": "āَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مَعَكُم", "translit": "mُkَʿعَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مُّسْتَمِعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعِmَtْsُّm", "root": "سمع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 16, "text": "فَأْتِيَا فِرْعَوْنَ فَقُولَآ إِنَّا رَسُولُ رَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "Go to Pharaoh and say, 'We are the messengers[1] of the Lord of the worlds,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأْتِيَا", "translit": "āَyِtْaʾَf", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "translit": "َnْwَʿعْrِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَقُولَآ", "translit": "ٓāَlwُqَf", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِنَّا", "translit": "āَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "رَسُولُ", "translit": "ُlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 17, "text": "أَنْ أَرْسِلْ مَعَنَا بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ", "translation": "[Commanded to say], \"Send with us the Children of Israel.\"'\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَنْ", "translit": "ْnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَرْسِلْ", "translit": "ْlِsْrَaʾ", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَعَنَا", "translit": "āَnَʿعَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بَنِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِnَb", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِءَٰٓrْsِiʾ", "root": ""}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 18, "text": "قَالَ أَلَمْ نُرَبِّكَ فِينَا وَلِيدًا وَلَبِثْتَ فِينَا مِنْ عُمُرِكَ سِنِينَ ", "translation": "[Pharaoh] said, \"Did we not raise you among us as a child, and you remained among us for years of your life?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَلَمْ", "translit": "ْmَlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نُرَبِّكَ", "translit": "َkِّbَrُn", "root": "ربو"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فِينَا", "translit": "āَnyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَلِيدًا", "translit": "āًdyِlَw", "root": "ولد"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَلَبِثْتَ", "translit": "َtْhtِbَlَw", "root": "لبث"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فِينَا", "translit": "āَnyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عُمُرِكَ", "translit": "َkِrُmُʿع", "root": "عمر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "سِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِs", "root": "سنو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 19, "text": "وَفَعَلْتَ فَعْلَتَكَ ٱلَّتِى فَعَلْتَ وَأَنتَ مِنَ ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ ", "translation": "And [then] you did your deed which you did,[1] and you were of the ungrateful.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَفَعَلْتَ", "translit": "َtْlَʿعَfَw", "root": "فعل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فَعْلَتَكَ", "translit": "َkَtَlْʿعَf", "root": "فعل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلَّتِى", "translit": "àِtَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَعَلْتَ", "translit": "َtْlَʿعَf", "root": "فعل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَأَنتَ", "translit": "َtnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِfَٰkْlٱ", "root": "كفر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 20, "text": "قَالَ فَعَلْتُهَآ إِذًا وَأَنَا۠ مِنَ ٱلضَّآلِّينَ ", "translation": "[Moses] said, \"I did it, then, while I was of those astray [i.e., ignorant].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فَعَلْتُهَآ", "translit": "ٓāَhُtْlَʿعَf", "root": "فعل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِذًا", "translit": "āًhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَأَنَا۠", "translit": "۠āَnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلضَّآلِّينَ", "translit": "َnyِّlٓāَّḍlٱ", "root": "ضلل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 21, "text": "فَفَرَرْتُ مِنكُمْ لَمَّا خِفْتُكُمْ فَوَهَبَ لِى رَبِّى حُكْمًا وَجَعَلَنِى مِنَ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ ", "translation": "So I fled from you when I feared you. Then my Lord granted me judgement [i.e., wisdom and prophethood] and appointed me [as one] of the messengers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَفَرَرْتُ", "translit": "ُtْrَrَfَf", "root": "فرر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِنكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُknِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "خِفْتُكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُtْfِhk", "root": "خوف"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فَوَهَبَ", "translit": "َbَhَwَf", "root": "وهب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لِى", "translit": "àِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "رَبِّى", "translit": "àِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "حُكْمًا", "translit": "āًmْkُḥ", "root": "حكم"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَجَعَلَنِى", "translit": "àِnَlَʿعَjgَw", "root": "جعل"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَsْrُmْlٱ", "root": "رسل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 22, "text": "وَتِلْكَ نِعْمَةٌ تَمُنُّهَا عَلَىَّ أَنْ عَبَّدتَّ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ", "translation": "And is this a favor of which you remind me - that you have enslaved the Children of Israel?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَتِلْكَ", "translit": "َkْlِtَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نِعْمَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَmْʿعِn", "root": "نعم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "تَمُنُّهَا", "translit": "āَhُّnُmَt", "root": "منن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "عَلَىَّ", "translit": "َّàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَنْ", "translit": "ْnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "عَبَّدتَّ", "translit": "َّtdَّbَʿع", "root": "عبد"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بَنِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِnَb", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِءَٰٓrْsِiʾ", "root": ""}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 23, "text": "قَالَ فِرْعَوْنُ وَمَا رَبُّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "Said Pharaoh, \"And what is the Lord of the worlds?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِرْعَوْنُ", "translit": "ُnْwَʿعْrِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "رَبُّ", "translit": "ُّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 24, "text": "قَالَ رَبُّ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَآۖ إِن كُنتُم مُّوقِنِينَ ", "translation": "[Moses] said, \"The Lord of the heavens and earth and that between them, if you should be convinced.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبُّ", "translit": "ُّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰwَٰmَّslٱ", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْrَaʾْlٱَw", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بَيْنَهُمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmُhَnْyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كُنتُم", "translit": "mُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مُّوقِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِqwُّm", "root": "يقن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 25, "text": "قَالَ لِمَنْ حَوْلَهُۥٓ أَلَا تَسْتَمِعُونَ ", "translation": "[Pharaoh] said to those around him, \"Do you not hear?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لِمَنْ", "translit": "ْnَmِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "حَوْلَهُۥٓ", "translit": "ٓۥُhَlْwَḥ", "root": "حول"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَلَا", "translit": "āَlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَسْتَمِعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعِmَtْsَt", "root": "سمع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 26, "text": "قَالَ رَبُّكُمْ وَرَبُّ ءَابَآئِكُمُ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ ", "translation": "[Moses] said, \"Your Lord and the Lord of your first forefathers.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبُّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَرَبُّ", "translit": "ُّbَrَw", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ءَابَآئِكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkِyʾٓāَbāَء", "root": "ابو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَّwَaʾْlٱ", "root": "اول"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 27, "text": "قَالَ إِنَّ رَسُولَكُمُ ٱلَّذِىٓ أُرْسِلَ إِلَيْكُمْ لَمَجْنُونٌ ", "translation": "[Pharaoh] said,[1] \"Indeed, your 'messenger' who has been sent to you is mad.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَسُولَكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkَlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أُرْسِلَ", "translit": "َlِsْrُaʾ", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِلَيْكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkْyَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "لَمَجْنُونٌ", "translit": "ٌnwُnْjgَmَl", "root": "جنن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 28, "text": "قَالَ رَبُّ ٱلْمَشْرِقِ وَٱلْمَغْرِبِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَآۖ إِن كُنتُمْ تَعْقِلُونَ ", "translation": "[Moses] said, \"Lord of the east and the west and that between them, if you were to reason.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبُّ", "translit": "ُّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْمَشْرِقِ", "translit": "ِqِrْhsَmْlٱ", "root": "شرق"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَٱلْمَغْرِبِ", "translit": "ِbِrْغَmْlٱَw", "root": "غرب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بَيْنَهُمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmُhَnْyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "تَعْقِلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlِqْʿعَt", "root": "عقل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 29, "text": "قَالَ لَئِنِ ٱتَّخَذْتَ إِلَٰهًا غَيْرِى لَأَجْعَلَنَّكَ مِنَ ٱلْمَسْجُونِينَ ", "translation": "[Pharaoh] said, \"If you take a god other than me, I will surely place you among those imprisoned.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَئِنِ", "translit": "ِnِyʾَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱتَّخَذْتَ", "translit": "َtْhdَhkَّtٱ", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِلَٰهًا", "translit": "āًhَٰlِiʾ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "غَيْرِى", "translit": "àِrْyَغ", "root": "غير"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَأَجْعَلَنَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّnَlَʿعْjgَaʾَl", "root": "جعل"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلْمَسْجُونِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnwُjgْsَmْlٱ", "root": "سجن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 30, "text": "قَالَ أَوَلَوْ جِئْتُكَ بِشَىْءٍ مُّبِينٍ ", "translation": "[Moses] said, \"Even if I brought you something [i.e., proof] manifest?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَوَلَوْ", "translit": "ْwَlَwَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "جِئْتُكَ", "translit": "َkُtْyʾِjg", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِشَىْءٍ", "translit": "ٍءْàَhsِb", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مُّبِينٍ", "translit": "ٍnyِbُّm", "root": "بين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 31, "text": "قَالَ فَأْتِ بِهِۦٓ إِن كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلصَّٰدِقِينَ ", "translation": "[Pharaoh] said, \"Then bring it, if you should be of the truthful.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فَأْتِ", "translit": "ِtْaʾَf", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِهِۦٓ", "translit": "ٓۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كُنتَ", "translit": "َtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلصَّٰدِقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqِdَّٰṣlٱ", "root": "صدق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 32, "text": "فَأَلْقَىٰ عَصَاهُ فَإِذَا هِىَ ثُعْبَانٌ مُّبِينٌ ", "translation": "So [Moses] threw his staff, and suddenly it was a serpent manifest.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَلْقَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَqْlَaʾَf", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَصَاهُ", "translit": "ُhāَṣَʿع", "root": "عصو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "هِىَ", "translit": "َàِh", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ثُعْبَانٌ", "translit": "ٌnāَbْʿعُht", "root": "ثعب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مُّبِينٌ", "translit": "ٌnyِbُّm", "root": "بين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 33, "text": "وَنَزَعَ يَدَهُۥ فَإِذَا هِىَ بَيْضَآءُ لِلنَّٰظِرِينَ ", "translation": "And he drew out his hand; thereupon it was white for the observers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَنَزَعَ", "translit": "َʿعَzَnَw", "root": "نزع"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَدَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَdَy", "root": "يدي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "هِىَ", "translit": "َàِh", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بَيْضَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَḍْyَb", "root": "بيض"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لِلنَّٰظِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِẓَّٰnlِl", "root": "نظر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 34, "text": "قَالَ لِلْمَلَإِ حَوْلَهُۥٓ إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَسَٰحِرٌ عَلِيمٌ ", "translation": "[Pharaoh] said to the eminent ones around him, \"Indeed, this is a learned magician.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لِلْمَلَإِ", "translit": "ِiʾَlَmْlِl", "root": "ملا"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "حَوْلَهُۥٓ", "translit": "ٓۥُhَlْwَḥ", "root": "حول"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "هَٰذَا", "translit": "āَhdَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَسَٰحِرٌ", "translit": "ٌrِḥَٰsَl", "root": "سحر"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "عَلِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 35, "text": "يُرِيدُ أَن يُخْرِجَكُم مِّنْ أَرْضِكُم بِسِحْرِهِۦ فَمَاذَا تَأْمُرُونَ ", "translation": "He wants to drive you out of your land by his magic, so what do you advise?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يُرِيدُ", "translit": "ُdyِrُy", "root": "رود"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يُخْرِجَكُم", "translit": "mُkَjgِrْhkُy", "root": "خرج"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِّنْ", "translit": "ْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَرْضِكُم", "translit": "mُkِḍْrَaʾ", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِسِحْرِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِrْḥِsِb", "root": "سحر"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَمَاذَا", "translit": "āَhdāَmَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "تَأْمُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُmْaʾَt", "root": "امر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 36, "text": "قَالُوٓا۟ أَرْجِهْ وَأَخَاهُ وَٱبْعَثْ فِى ٱلْمَدَآئِنِ حَٰشِرِينَ ", "translation": "They said, \"Postpone [the matter of] him and his brother and send among the cities gatherers", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَرْجِهْ", "translit": "ْhِjgْrَaʾ", "root": "رجو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَخَاهُ", "translit": "ُhāَhkَaʾَw", "root": "اخو"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَٱبْعَثْ", "translit": "ْhtَʿعْbٱَw", "root": "بعث"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْمَدَآئِنِ", "translit": "ِnِyʾٓāَdَmْlٱ", "root": "مدن"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "حَٰشِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِhsَٰḥ", "root": "حشر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 37, "text": "يَأْتُوكَ بِكُلِّ سَحَّارٍ عَلِيمٍ ", "translation": "Who will bring you every learned, skilled magician.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَأْتُوكَ", "translit": "َkwُtْaʾَy", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِكُلِّ", "translit": "ِّlُkِb", "root": "كلل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "سَحَّارٍ", "translit": "ٍrāَّḥَs", "root": "سحر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "عَلِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِlَʿع", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 38, "text": "فَجُمِعَ ٱلسَّحَرَةُ لِمِيقَٰتِ يَوْمٍ مَّعْلُومٍ ", "translation": "So the magicians were assembled for the appointment of a well-known day.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَجُمِعَ", "translit": "َʿعِmُjgَf", "root": "جمع"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلسَّحَرَةُ", "translit": "ُẗَrَḥَّslٱ", "root": "سحر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِمِيقَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰqyِmِl", "root": "وقت"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَوْمٍ", "translit": "ٍmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مَّعْلُومٍ", "translit": "ٍmwُlْʿعَّm", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 39, "text": "وَقِيلَ لِلنَّاسِ هَلْ أَنتُم مُّجْتَمِعُونَ ", "translation": "And it was said to the people, \"Will you congregate", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَقِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِqَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لِلنَّاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَّnlِl", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "هَلْ", "translit": "ْlَh", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَنتُم", "translit": "mُtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مُّجْتَمِعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعِmَtْjgُّm", "root": "جمع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 40, "text": "لَعَلَّنَا نَتَّبِعُ ٱلسَّحَرَةَ إِن كَانُوا۟ هُمُ ٱلْغَٰلِبِينَ ", "translation": "That we might follow the magicians if they are the predominant?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "لَعَلَّنَا", "translit": "āَnَّlَʿعَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَتَّبِعُ", "translit": "ُʿعِbَّtَn", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلسَّحَرَةَ", "translit": "َẗَrَḥَّslٱ", "root": "سحر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كَانُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "هُمُ", "translit": "ُmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْغَٰلِبِينَ", "translit": "َnyِbِlَٰغْlٱ", "root": "غلب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 41, "text": "فَلَمَّا جَآءَ ٱلسَّحَرَةُ قَالُوا۟ لِفِرْعَوْنَ أَئِنَّ لَنَا لَأَجْرًا إِن كُنَّا نَحْنُ ٱلْغَٰلِبِينَ ", "translation": "And when the magicians arrived, they said to Pharaoh, \"Is there indeed for us a reward if we are the predominant?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "جَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَjg", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلسَّحَرَةُ", "translit": "ُẗَrَḥَّslٱ", "root": "سحر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لِفِرْعَوْنَ", "translit": "َnْwَʿعْrِfِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَئِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِyʾَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "لَنَا", "translit": "āَnَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "لَأَجْرًا", "translit": "āًrْjgَaʾَl", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "كُنَّا", "translit": "āَّnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "نَحْنُ", "translit": "ُnْḥَn", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱلْغَٰلِبِينَ", "translit": "َnyِbِlَٰغْlٱ", "root": "غلب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 42, "text": "قَالَ نَعَمْ وَإِنَّكُمْ إِذًا لَّمِنَ ٱلْمُقَرَّبِينَ ", "translation": "He said, \"Yes, and indeed, you will then be of those near [to me].\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَعَمْ", "translit": "ْmَʿعَn", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَإِنَّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِذًا", "translit": "āًhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لَّمِنَ", "translit": "َnِmَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْمُقَرَّبِينَ", "translit": "َnyِbَّrَqُmْlٱ", "root": "قرب"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 43, "text": "قَالَ لَهُم مُّوسَىٰٓ أَلْقُوا۟ مَآ أَنتُم مُّلْقُونَ ", "translation": "Moses said to them, \"Throw whatever you will throw.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَهُم", "translit": "mُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مُّوسَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَswُّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَلْقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqْlَaʾ", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مَآ", "translit": "ٓāَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَنتُم", "translit": "mُtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مُّلْقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqْlُّm", "root": "لقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 44, "text": "فَأَلْقَوْا۟ حِبَالَهُمْ وَعِصِيَّهُمْ وَقَالُوا۟ بِعِزَّةِ فِرْعَوْنَ إِنَّا لَنَحْنُ ٱلْغَٰلِبُونَ ", "translation": "So they threw their ropes and their staffs and said, \"By the might of Pharaoh, indeed it is we who are predominant.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَلْقَوْا۟", "translit": "۟āْwَqْlَaʾَf", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "حِبَالَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَlāَbِḥ", "root": "حبل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَعِصِيَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّyِṣِʿعَw", "root": "عصو"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَقَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَqَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بِعِزَّةِ", "translit": "ِẗَّzِʿعِb", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "translit": "َnْwَʿعْrِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِنَّا", "translit": "āَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "لَنَحْنُ", "translit": "ُnْḥَnَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْغَٰلِبُونَ", "translit": "َnwُbِlَٰغْlٱ", "root": "غلب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 45, "text": "فَأَلْقَىٰ مُوسَىٰ عَصَاهُ فَإِذَا هِىَ تَلْقَفُ مَا يَأْفِكُونَ ", "translation": "Then Moses threw his staff, and at once it devoured what they falsified.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَلْقَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَqْlَaʾَf", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مُوسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَصَاهُ", "translit": "ُhāَṣَʿع", "root": "عصو"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "هِىَ", "translit": "َàِh", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَلْقَفُ", "translit": "ُfَqْlَt", "root": "لقف"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يَأْفِكُونَ", "translit": "َnwُkِfْaʾَy", "root": "افك"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 46, "text": "فَأُلْقِىَ ٱلسَّحَرَةُ سَٰجِدِينَ ", "translation": "So the magicians fell down in prostration [to Allāh].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأُلْقِىَ", "translit": "َàِqْlُaʾَf", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلسَّحَرَةُ", "translit": "ُẗَrَḥَّslٱ", "root": "سحر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "سَٰجِدِينَ", "translit": "َnyِdِjgَٰs", "root": "سجد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 47, "text": "قَالُوٓا۟ ءَامَنَّا بِرَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "They said, \"We have believed in the Lord of the worlds,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ءَامَنَّا", "translit": "āَّnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِرَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَrِb", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 48, "text": "رَبِّ مُوسَىٰ وَهَٰرُونَ ", "translation": "The Lord of Moses and Aaron.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مُوسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَهَٰرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrَٰhَw", "root": ""}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 49, "text": "قَالَ ءَامَنتُمْ لَهُۥ قَبْلَ أَنْ ءَاذَنَ لَكُمْۖ إِنَّهُۥ لَكَبِيرُكُمُ ٱلَّذِى عَلَّمَكُمُ ٱلسِّحْرَ فَلَسَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَۚ لَأُقَطِّعَنَّ أَيْدِيَكُمْ وَأَرْجُلَكُم مِّنْ خِلَٰفٍ وَلَأُصَلِّبَنَّكُمْ أَجْمَعِينَ ", "translation": "[Pharaoh] said, \"You believed him [i.e., Moses] before I gave you permission. Indeed, he is your leader who has taught you magic, but you are going to know. I will surely cut off your hands and your feet on opposite sides, and I will surely crucify you all.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ءَامَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَبْلَ", "translit": "َlْbَq", "root": "قبل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَنْ", "translit": "ْnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ءَاذَنَ", "translit": "َnَhdāَء", "root": "اذن"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "لَكَبِيرُكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkُryِbَkَl", "root": "كبر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِى", "translit": "àِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "عَلَّمَكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkَmَّlَʿع", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ٱلسِّحْرَ", "translit": "َrْḥِّslٱ", "root": "سحر"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "فَلَسَوْفَ", "translit": "َfْwَsَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَlْʿعَt", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "لَأُقَطِّعَنَّ", "translit": "َّnَʿعِّṭَqُaʾَl", "root": "قطع"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "أَيْدِيَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَyِdْyَaʾ", "root": "يدي"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "وَأَرْجُلَكُم", "translit": "mُkَlُjgْrَaʾَw", "root": "رجل"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "مِّنْ", "translit": "ْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "خِلَٰفٍ", "translit": "ٍfَٰlِhk", "root": "خلف"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "وَلَأُصَلِّبَنَّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَّnَbِّlَṣُaʾَlَw", "root": "صلب"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "أَجْمَعِينَ", "translit": "َnyِʿعَmْjgَaʾ", "root": "جمع"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 50, "text": "قَالُوا۟ لَا ضَيْرَۖ إِنَّآ إِلَىٰ رَبِّنَا مُنقَلِبُونَ ", "translation": "They said, \"No harm. Indeed, to our Lord we will return.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ضَيْرَ", "translit": "َrْyَḍ", "root": "ضير"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِنَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "رَبِّنَا", "translit": "āَnِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مُنقَلِبُونَ", "translit": "َnwُbِlَqnُm", "root": "قلب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 51, "text": "إِنَّا نَطْمَعُ أَن يَغْفِرَ لَنَا رَبُّنَا خَطَٰيَٰنَآ أَن كُنَّآ أَوَّلَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed, we aspire that our Lord will forgive us our sins because we were the first of the believers.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّا", "translit": "āَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَطْمَعُ", "translit": "ُʿعَmْṭَn", "root": "طمع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَغْفِرَ", "translit": "َrِfْغَy", "root": "غفر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لَنَا", "translit": "āَnَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "رَبُّنَا", "translit": "āَnُّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "خَطَٰيَٰنَآ", "translit": "ٓāَnَٰyَٰṭَhk", "root": "خطا"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "كُنَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "أَوَّلَ", "translit": "َlَّwَaʾ", "root": "اول"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُmْlٱ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 52, "text": "وَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَىٰ مُوسَىٰٓ أَنْ أَسْرِ بِعِبَادِىٓ إِنَّكُم مُّتَّبَعُونَ ", "translation": "And We inspired to Moses, \"Travel by night with My servants; indeed, you will be pursued.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَوْحَيْنَآ", "translit": "ٓāَnْyَḥْwَaʾَw", "root": "وحي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مُوسَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَنْ", "translit": "ْnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَسْرِ", "translit": "ِrْsَaʾ", "root": "سري"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِعِبَادِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِdāَbِʿعِb", "root": "عبد"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِنَّكُم", "translit": "mُkَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مُّتَّبَعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعَbَّtُّm", "root": "تبع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 53, "text": "فَأَرْسَلَ فِرْعَوْنُ فِى ٱلْمَدَآئِنِ حَٰشِرِينَ ", "translation": "Then Pharaoh sent among the cities gatherers[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَرْسَلَ", "translit": "َlَsْrَaʾَf", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِرْعَوْنُ", "translit": "ُnْwَʿعْrِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمَدَآئِنِ", "translit": "ِnِyʾٓāَdَmْlٱ", "root": "مدن"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "حَٰشِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِhsَٰḥ", "root": "حشر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 54, "text": "إِنَّ هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ لَشِرْذِمَةٌ قَلِيلُونَ ", "translation": "[And said], \"Indeed, those are but a small band,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَlُwʾَٰٓh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَشِرْذِمَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَmِhdْrِhsَl", "root": "شرذم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَلِيلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlyِlَq", "root": "قلل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 55, "text": "وَإِنَّهُمْ لَنَا لَغَآئِظُونَ ", "translation": "And indeed, they are enraging us,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَنَا", "translit": "āَnَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَغَآئِظُونَ", "translit": "َnwُẓِyʾٓāَغَl", "root": "غيظ"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 56, "text": "وَإِنَّا لَجَمِيعٌ حَٰذِرُونَ ", "translation": "And indeed, we are a cautious society...\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّا", "translit": "āَّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَجَمِيعٌ", "translit": "ٌʿعyِmَjgَl", "root": "جمع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "حَٰذِرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrِhdَٰḥ", "root": "حذر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 57, "text": "فَأَخْرَجْنَٰهُم مِّن جَنَّٰتٍ وَعُيُونٍ ", "translation": "So We removed them from gardens and springs", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَخْرَجْنَٰهُم", "translit": "mُhَٰnْjgَrْhkَaʾَf", "root": "خرج"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "جَنَّٰتٍ", "translit": "ٍtَّٰnَjg", "root": "جنن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَعُيُونٍ", "translit": "ٍnwُyُʿعَw", "root": "عين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 58, "text": "وَكُنُوزٍ وَمَقَامٍ كَرِيمٍ ", "translation": "And treasures and honorable station[1] -", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَكُنُوزٍ", "translit": "ٍzwُnُkَw", "root": "كنز"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَمَقَامٍ", "translit": "ٍmāَqَmَw", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كَرِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِrَk", "root": "كرم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 59, "text": "كَذَٰلِكَ وَأَوْرَثْنَٰهَا بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ", "translation": "Thus. And We caused to inherit it the Children of Israel.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhdَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَأَوْرَثْنَٰهَا", "translit": "āَhَٰnْhtَrْwَaʾَw", "root": "ورث"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بَنِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِnَb", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِءَٰٓrْsِiʾ", "root": ""}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 60, "text": "فَأَتْبَعُوهُم مُّشْرِقِينَ ", "translation": "So they pursued them at sunrise.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَتْبَعُوهُم", "translit": "mُhwُʿعَbْtَaʾَf", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مُّشْرِقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqِrْhsُّm", "root": "شرق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 61, "text": "فَلَمَّا تَرَٰٓءَا ٱلْجَمْعَانِ قَالَ أَصْحَٰبُ مُوسَىٰٓ إِنَّا لَمُدْرَكُونَ ", "translation": "And when the two companies saw one another, the companions of Moses said, \"Indeed, we are to be overtaken!\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَرَٰٓءَا", "translit": "āَءَٰٓrَt", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْجَمْعَانِ", "translit": "ِnāَʿعْmَjgْlٱ", "root": "جمع"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَصْحَٰبُ", "translit": "ُbَٰḥْṣَaʾ", "root": "صحب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مُوسَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "إِنَّا", "translit": "āَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "لَمُدْرَكُونَ", "translit": "َnwُkَrْdُmَl", "root": "درك"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 62, "text": "قَالَ كَلَّآۖ إِنَّ مَعِىَ رَبِّى سَيَهْدِينِ ", "translation": "[Moses] said, \"No! Indeed, with me is my Lord; He will guide me.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "كَلَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّlَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَعِىَ", "translit": "َàِʿعَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "رَبِّى", "translit": "àِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "سَيَهْدِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِdْhَyَs", "root": "هدي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 63, "text": "فَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَىٰ مُوسَىٰٓ أَنِ ٱضْرِب بِّعَصَاكَ ٱلْبَحْرَۖ فَٱنفَلَقَ فَكَانَ كُلُّ فِرْقٍ كَٱلطَّوْدِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ ", "translation": "Then We inspired to Moses, \"Strike with your staff the sea,\" and it parted, and each portion was like a great towering mountain.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَوْحَيْنَآ", "translit": "ٓāَnْyَḥْwَaʾَf", "root": "وحي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مُوسَىٰٓ", "translit": "ٰٓàَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَنِ", "translit": "ِnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱضْرِب", "translit": "bِrْḍٱ", "root": "ضرب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِّعَصَاكَ", "translit": "َkāَṣَʿعِّb", "root": "عصو"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْبَحْرَ", "translit": "َrْḥَbْlٱ", "root": "بحر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "فَٱنفَلَقَ", "translit": "َqَlَfnٱَf", "root": "فلق"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "فَكَانَ", "translit": "َnāَkَf", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "كُلُّ", "translit": "ُّlُk", "root": "كلل"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "فِرْقٍ", "translit": "ٍqْrِf", "root": "فرق"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "كَٱلطَّوْدِ", "translit": "ِdْwَّṭlٱَk", "root": "طود"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱلْعَظِيمِ", "translit": "ِmyِẓَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عظم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 64, "text": "وَأَزْلَفْنَا ثَمَّ ٱلْءَاخَرِينَ ", "translation": "And We advanced thereto the others [i.e., the pursuers].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَزْلَفْنَا", "translit": "āَnْfَlْzَaʾَw", "root": "زلف"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ثَمَّ", "translit": "َّmَht", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْءَاخَرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrَhkāَءْlٱ", "root": "اخر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 65, "text": "وَأَنجَيْنَا مُوسَىٰ وَمَن مَّعَهُۥٓ أَجْمَعِينَ ", "translation": "And We saved Moses and those with him, all together.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَنجَيْنَا", "translit": "āَnْyَjgnَaʾَw", "root": "نجو"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مُوسَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَswُm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَمَن", "translit": "nَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَّعَهُۥٓ", "translit": "ٓۥُhَʿعَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَجْمَعِينَ", "translit": "َnyِʿعَmْjgَaʾ", "root": "جمع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 66, "text": "ثُمَّ أَغْرَقْنَا ٱلْءَاخَرِينَ ", "translation": "Then We drowned the others.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَغْرَقْنَا", "translit": "āَnْqَrْغَaʾ", "root": "غرق"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْءَاخَرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrَhkāَءْlٱ", "root": "اخر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 67, "text": "إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَءَايَةًۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكْثَرُهُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَءَl", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَكْثَرُهُم", "translit": "mُhُrَhtْkَaʾ", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُّm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 68, "text": "وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ ", "translation": "And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translit": "ُzyِzَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِḥَّrlٱ", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 69, "text": "وَٱتْلُ عَلَيْهِمْ نَبَأَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ ", "translation": "And recite to them the news of Abraham,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱتْلُ", "translit": "ُlْtٱَw", "root": "تلو"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نَبَأَ", "translit": "َaʾَbَn", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِبْرَٰهِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِhَٰrْbِiʾ", "root": ""}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 70, "text": "إِذْ قَالَ لِأَبِيهِ وَقَوْمِهِۦ مَا تَعْبُدُونَ ", "translation": "When he said to his father and his people, \"What do you worship?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِأَبِيهِ", "translit": "ِhyِbَaʾِl", "root": "ابو"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَقَوْمِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِmْwَqَw", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَعْبُدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdُbْʿعَt", "root": "عبد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 71, "text": "قَالُوا۟ نَعْبُدُ أَصْنَامًا فَنَظَلُّ لَهَا عَٰكِفِينَ ", "translation": "They said, \"We worship idols and remain to them devoted.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَعْبُدُ", "translit": "ُdُbْʿعَn", "root": "عبد"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَصْنَامًا", "translit": "āًmāَnْṣَaʾ", "root": "صنم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَنَظَلُّ", "translit": "ُّlَẓَnَf", "root": "ظلل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لَهَا", "translit": "āَhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "عَٰكِفِينَ", "translit": "َnyِfِkَٰʿع", "root": "عكف"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 72, "text": "قَالَ هَلْ يَسْمَعُونَكُمْ إِذْ تَدْعُونَ ", "translation": "He said, \"Do they hear you when you supplicate?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هَلْ", "translit": "ْlَh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يَسْمَعُونَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَnwُʿعَmْsَy", "root": "سمع"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَدْعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعْdَt", "root": "دعو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 73, "text": "أَوْ يَنفَعُونَكُمْ أَوْ يَضُرُّونَ ", "translation": "Or do they benefit you, or do they harm?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَوْ", "translit": "ْwَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَنفَعُونَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَnwُʿعَfnَy", "root": "نفع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَوْ", "translit": "ْwَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَضُرُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّrُḍَy", "root": "ضرر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 74, "text": "قَالُوا۟ بَلْ وَجَدْنَآ ءَابَآءَنَا كَذَٰلِكَ يَفْعَلُونَ ", "translation": "They said, \"But we found our fathers doing thus.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بَلْ", "translit": "ْlَb", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَجَدْنَآ", "translit": "ٓāَnْdَjgَw", "root": "وجد"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ءَابَآءَنَا", "translit": "āَnَءٓāَbāَء", "root": "ابو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhdَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يَفْعَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَʿعْfَy", "root": "فعل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 75, "text": "قَالَ أَفَرَءَيْتُم مَّا كُنتُمْ تَعْبُدُونَ ", "translation": "He said, \"Then do you see what you have been worshipping,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَفَرَءَيْتُم", "translit": "mُtْyَءَrَfَaʾ", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَّا", "translit": "āَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَعْبُدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdُbْʿعَt", "root": "عبد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 76, "text": "أَنتُمْ وَءَابَآؤُكُمُ ٱلْأَقْدَمُونَ ", "translation": "You and your ancient forefathers?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَءَابَآؤُكُمُ", "translit": "ُmُkُwʾٓāَbāَءَw", "root": "ابو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْأَقْدَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَdْqَaʾْlٱ", "root": "قدم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 77, "text": "فَإِنَّهُمْ عَدُوٌّ لِّىٓ إِلَّا رَبَّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed, they are enemies to me, except the Lord of the worlds,[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَإِنَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّnِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَدُوٌّ", "translit": "ٌّwُdَʿع", "root": "عدو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "رَبَّ", "translit": "َّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 78, "text": "ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَنِى فَهُوَ يَهْدِينِ ", "translation": "Who created me, and He [it is who] guides me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِى", "translit": "àِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "خَلَقَنِى", "translit": "àِnَqَlَhk", "root": "خلق"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَهْدِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِdْhَy", "root": "هدي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 79, "text": "وَٱلَّذِى هُوَ يُطْعِمُنِى وَيَسْقِينِ ", "translation": "And it is He who feeds me and gives me drink.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلَّذِى", "translit": "àِhdَّlٱَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يُطْعِمُنِى", "translit": "àِnُmِʿعْṭُy", "root": "طعم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَيَسْقِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِqْsَyَw", "root": "سقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 80, "text": "وَإِذَا مَرِضْتُ فَهُوَ يَشْفِينِ ", "translation": "And when I am ill, it is He who cures me", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَرِضْتُ", "translit": "ُtْḍِrَm", "root": "مرض"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَشْفِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِfْhsَy", "root": "شفي"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 81, "text": "وَٱلَّذِى يُمِيتُنِى ثُمَّ يُحْيِينِ ", "translation": "And who will cause me to die and then bring me to life", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلَّذِى", "translit": "àِhdَّlٱَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يُمِيتُنِى", "translit": "àِnُtyِmُy", "root": "موت"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يُحْيِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِyْḥُy", "root": "حيي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 82, "text": "وَٱلَّذِىٓ أَطْمَعُ أَن يَغْفِرَ لِى خَطِيٓـَٔتِى يَوْمَ ٱلدِّينِ ", "translation": "And who I aspire that He will forgive me my sin on the Day of Recompense.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلَّذِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِhdَّlٱَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَطْمَعُ", "translit": "ُʿعَmْṭَaʾ", "root": "طمع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَغْفِرَ", "translit": "َrِfْغَy", "root": "غفر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لِى", "translit": "àِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "خَطِيٓـَٔتِى", "translit": "àِtَٔـٓyِṭَhk", "root": "خطا"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلدِّينِ", "translit": "ِnyِّdlٱ", "root": "دين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 83, "text": "رَبِّ هَبْ لِى حُكْمًا وَأَلْحِقْنِى بِٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ ", "translation": "[And he said], \"My Lord, grant me authority and join me with the righteous.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هَبْ", "translit": "ْbَh", "root": "وهب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِى", "translit": "àِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "حُكْمًا", "translit": "āًmْkُḥ", "root": "حكم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَأَلْحِقْنِى", "translit": "àِnْqِḥْlَaʾَw", "root": "لحق"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ", "translit": "َnyِḥِlَّٰṣlٱِb", "root": "صلح"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 84, "text": "وَٱجْعَل لِّى لِسَانَ صِدْقٍ فِى ٱلْءَاخِرِينَ ", "translation": "And grant me a mention [i.e., reputation] of honor among later generations.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱجْعَل", "translit": "lَʿعْjgٱَw", "root": "جعل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لِّى", "translit": "àِّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِسَانَ", "translit": "َnāَsِl", "root": "لسن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "صِدْقٍ", "translit": "ٍqْdِṣ", "root": "صدق"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْءَاخِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِhkāَءْlٱ", "root": "اخر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 85, "text": "وَٱجْعَلْنِى مِن وَرَثَةِ جَنَّةِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ ", "translation": "And place me among the inheritors of the Garden of Pleasure.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱجْعَلْنِى", "translit": "àِnْlَʿعْjgٱَw", "root": "جعل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَرَثَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَhtَrَw", "root": "ورث"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "جَنَّةِ", "translit": "ِẗَّnَjg", "root": "جنن"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلنَّعِيمِ", "translit": "ِmyِʿعَّnlٱ", "root": "نعم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 86, "text": "وَٱغْفِرْ لِأَبِىٓ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ مِنَ ٱلضَّآلِّينَ ", "translation": "And forgive my father. Indeed, he has been of those astray.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱغْفِرْ", "translit": "ْrِfْغٱَw", "root": "غفر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لِأَبِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِbَaʾِl", "root": "ابو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلضَّآلِّينَ", "translit": "َnyِّlٓāَّḍlٱ", "root": "ضلل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 87, "text": "وَلَا تُخْزِنِى يَوْمَ يُبْعَثُونَ ", "translation": "And do not disgrace me on the Day they are [all] resurrected -", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تُخْزِنِى", "translit": "àِnِzْhkُt", "root": "خزي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يُبْعَثُونَ", "translit": "َnwُhtَʿعْbُy", "root": "بعث"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 88, "text": "يَوْمَ لَا يَنفَعُ مَالٌ وَلَا بَنُونَ ", "translation": "The Day when there will not benefit [anyone] wealth or children", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يَنفَعُ", "translit": "ُʿعَfnَy", "root": "نفع"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَالٌ", "translit": "ٌlāَm", "root": "مول"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بَنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnَb", "root": "بني"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 89, "text": "إِلَّا مَنْ أَتَى ٱللَّهَ بِقَلْبٍ سَلِيمٍ ", "translation": "But only one who comes to Allāh with a sound heart.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَنْ", "translit": "ْnَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَتَى", "translit": "àَtَaʾ", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بِقَلْبٍ", "translit": "ٍbْlَqِb", "root": "قلب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "سَلِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِlَs", "root": "سلم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 90, "text": "وَأُزْلِفَتِ ٱلْجَنَّةُ لِلْمُتَّقِينَ ", "translation": "And Paradise will be brought near [that Day] to the righteous.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأُزْلِفَتِ", "translit": "ِtَfِlْzُaʾَw", "root": "زلف"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْجَنَّةُ", "translit": "ُẗَّnَjgْlٱ", "root": "جنن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِلْمُتَّقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqَّtُmْlِl", "root": "وقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 91, "text": "وَبُرِّزَتِ ٱلْجَحِيمُ لِلْغَاوِينَ ", "translation": "And Hellfire will be brought forth for the deviators,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَبُرِّزَتِ", "translit": "ِtَzِّrُbَw", "root": "برز"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْجَحِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِḥَjgْlٱ", "root": "جحم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِلْغَاوِينَ", "translit": "َnyِwāَغْlِl", "root": "غوي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 92, "text": "وَقِيلَ لَهُمْ أَيْنَ مَا كُنتُمْ تَعْبُدُونَ ", "translation": "And it will be said to them, \"Where are those you used to worship", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَقِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِqَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَيْنَ", "translit": "َnْyَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كُنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَعْبُدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdُbْʿعَt", "root": "عبد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 93, "text": "مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ هَلْ يَنصُرُونَكُمْ أَوْ يَنتَصِرُونَ ", "translation": "Other than Allāh? Can they help you or help themselves?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "دُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُd", "root": "دون"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "هَلْ", "translit": "ْlَh", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَنصُرُونَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَnwُrُṣnَy", "root": "نصر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَوْ", "translit": "ْwَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يَنتَصِرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrِṣَtnَy", "root": "نصر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 94, "text": "فَكُبْكِبُوا۟ فِيهَا هُمْ وَٱلْغَاوُۥنَ ", "translation": "So they will be overturned into it [i.e., Hellfire], they and the deviators", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَكُبْكِبُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُbِkْbُkَf", "root": "كبكب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِيهَا", "translit": "āَhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "هُمْ", "translit": "ْmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَٱلْغَاوُۥنَ", "translit": "َnۥُwāَغْlٱَw", "root": "غوي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 95, "text": "وَجُنُودُ إِبْلِيسَ أَجْمَعُونَ ", "translation": "And the soldiers of Iblees, all together.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَجُنُودُ", "translit": "ُdwُnُjgَw", "root": "جند"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِبْلِيسَ", "translit": "َsyِlْbِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَجْمَعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعَmْjgَaʾ", "root": "جمع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 96, "text": "قَالُوا۟ وَهُمْ فِيهَا يَخْتَصِمُونَ ", "translation": "They will say while they dispute therein,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِيهَا", "translit": "āَhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَخْتَصِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِṣَtْhkَy", "root": "خصم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 97, "text": "تَٱللَّهِ إِن كُنَّا لَفِى ضَلَٰلٍ مُّبِينٍ ", "translation": "\"By Allāh, we were indeed in manifest error", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "تَٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱَt", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كُنَّا", "translit": "āَّnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَفِى", "translit": "àِfَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ضَلَٰلٍ", "translit": "ٍlَٰlَḍ", "root": "ضلل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مُّبِينٍ", "translit": "ٍnyِbُّm", "root": "بين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 98, "text": "إِذْ نُسَوِّيكُم بِرَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "When we equated you with the Lord of the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نُسَوِّيكُم", "translit": "mُkyِّwَsُn", "root": "سوي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِرَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَrِb", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 99, "text": "وَمَآ أَضَلَّنَآ إِلَّا ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ ", "translation": "And no one misguided us except the criminals.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَضَلَّنَآ", "translit": "ٓāَnَّlَḍَaʾ", "root": "ضلل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmِrْjgُmْlٱ", "root": "جرم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 100, "text": "فَمَا لَنَا مِن شَٰفِعِينَ ", "translation": "So now we have no intercessors", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَمَا", "translit": "āَmَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَنَا", "translit": "āَnَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "شَٰفِعِينَ", "translit": "َnyِʿعِfَٰhs", "root": "شفع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 101, "text": "وَلَا صَدِيقٍ حَمِيمٍ ", "translation": "And not a devoted friend.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "صَدِيقٍ", "translit": "ٍqyِdَṣ", "root": "صدق"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "حَمِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِmَḥ", "root": "حمم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 102, "text": "فَلَوْ أَنَّ لَنَا كَرَّةً فَنَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Then if we only had a return [to the world] and could be of the believers...\"[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَوْ", "translit": "ْwَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَنَّ", "translit": "َّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَنَا", "translit": "āَnَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "كَرَّةً", "translit": "ًẗَّrَk", "root": "كرر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فَنَكُونَ", "translit": "َnwُkَnَf", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُmْlٱ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 103, "text": "إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَءَايَةًۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكْثَرُهُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَءَl", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَكْثَرُهُم", "translit": "mُhُrَhtْkَaʾ", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُّm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 104, "text": "وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ ", "translation": "And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translit": "ُzyِzَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِḥَّrlٱ", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 105, "text": "كَذَّبَتْ قَوْمُ نُوحٍ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ ", "translation": "The people of Noah denied the messengers[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كَذَّبَتْ", "translit": "ْtَbَّhdَk", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَوْمُ", "translit": "ُmْwَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نُوحٍ", "translit": "ٍḥwُn", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَsْrُmْlٱ", "root": "رسل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 106, "text": "إِذْ قَالَ لَهُمْ أَخُوهُمْ نُوحٌ أَلَا تَتَّقُونَ ", "translation": "When their brother Noah said to them, \"Will you not fear Allāh?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَخُوهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhwُhkَaʾ", "root": "اخو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "نُوحٌ", "translit": "ٌḥwُn", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَلَا", "translit": "āَlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تَتَّقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqَّtَt", "root": "وقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 107, "text": "إِنِّى لَكُمْ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٌ ", "translation": "Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَسُولٌ", "translit": "ٌlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَمِينٌ", "translit": "ٌnyِmَaʾ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 108, "text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ ", "translation": "So fear Allāh and obey me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَf", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَطِيعُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُʿعyِṭَaʾَw", "root": "طوع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 109, "text": "وَمَآ أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ أَجْرٍۖ إِنْ أَجْرِىَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُlَٔـْsَaʾ", "root": "سال"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِ", "translit": "ِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَجْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَجْرِىَ", "translit": "َàِrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 110, "text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ ", "translation": "So fear Allāh and obey me.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَf", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَطِيعُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُʿعyِṭَaʾَw", "root": "طوع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 111, "text": "قَالُوٓا۟ أَنُؤْمِنُ لَكَ وَٱتَّبَعَكَ ٱلْأَرْذَلُونَ ", "translation": "They said, \"Should we believe you while you are followed by the lowest [class of people]?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَنُؤْمِنُ", "translit": "ُnِmْwʾُnَaʾ", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَكَ", "translit": "َkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَٱتَّبَعَكَ", "translit": "َkَʿعَbَّtٱَw", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْأَرْذَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَhdْrَaʾْlٱ", "root": "رذل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 112, "text": "قَالَ وَمَا عِلْمِى بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ ", "translation": "He said, \"And what is my knowledge of what they used to do?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عِلْمِى", "translit": "àِmْlِʿع", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كَانُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يَعْمَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَmْʿعَy", "root": "عمل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 113, "text": "إِنْ حِسَابُهُمْ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّىۖ لَوْ تَشْعُرُونَ ", "translation": "Their account is only upon my Lord, if you [could] perceive.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "حِسَابُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُbāَsِḥ", "root": "حسب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "رَبِّى", "translit": "àِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَوْ", "translit": "ْwَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تَشْعُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُʿعْhsَt", "root": "شعر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 114, "text": "وَمَآ أَنَا۠ بِطَارِدِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "And I am not one to drive away the believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَنَا۠", "translit": "۠āَnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِطَارِدِ", "translit": "ِdِrāَṭِb", "root": "طرد"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُmْlٱ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 115, "text": "إِنْ أَنَا۠ إِلَّا نَذِيرٌ مُّبِينٌ ", "translation": "I am only a clear warner.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَنَا۠", "translit": "۠āَnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "نَذِيرٌ", "translit": "ٌryِhdَn", "root": "نذر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مُّبِينٌ", "translit": "ٌnyِbُّm", "root": "بين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 116, "text": "قَالُوا۟ لَئِن لَّمْ تَنتَهِ يَٰنُوحُ لَتَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلْمَرْجُومِينَ ", "translation": "They said, \"If you do not desist, O Noah, you will surely be of those who are stoned.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَئِن", "translit": "nِyʾَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَّمْ", "translit": "ْmَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَنتَهِ", "translit": "ِhَtnَt", "root": "نهي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَٰنُوحُ", "translit": "ُḥwُnَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَتَكُونَنَّ", "translit": "َّnَnwُkَtَl", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلْمَرْجُومِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmwُjgْrَmْlٱ", "root": "رجم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 117, "text": "قَالَ رَبِّ إِنَّ قَوْمِى كَذَّبُونِ ", "translation": "He said, \"My Lord, indeed my people have denied me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَوْمِى", "translit": "àِmْwَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كَذَّبُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُbَّhdَk", "root": "كذب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 118, "text": "فَٱفْتَحْ بَيْنِى وَبَيْنَهُمْ فَتْحًا وَنَجِّنِى وَمَن مَّعِىَ مِنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Then judge between me and them with decisive judgement and save me and those with me of the believers.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَٱفْتَحْ", "translit": "ْḥَtْfٱَf", "root": "فتح"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بَيْنِى", "translit": "àِnْyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَبَيْنَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَnْyَbَw", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَتْحًا", "translit": "āًḥْtَf", "root": "فتح"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَنَجِّنِى", "translit": "àِnِّjgَnَw", "root": "نجو"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَمَن", "translit": "nَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مَّعِىَ", "translit": "َàِʿعَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُmْlٱ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 119, "text": "فَأَنجَيْنَٰهُ وَمَن مَّعَهُۥ فِى ٱلْفُلْكِ ٱلْمَشْحُونِ ", "translation": "So We saved him and those with him in the laden ship.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَنجَيْنَٰهُ", "translit": "ُhَٰnْyَjgnَaʾَf", "root": "نجو"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَمَن", "translit": "nَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَّعَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَʿعَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْفُلْكِ", "translit": "ِkْlُfْlٱ", "root": "فلك"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْمَشْحُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُḥْhsَmْlٱ", "root": "شحن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 120, "text": "ثُمَّ أَغْرَقْنَا بَعْدُ ٱلْبَاقِينَ ", "translation": "Then We drowned thereafter the remaining ones.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَغْرَقْنَا", "translit": "āَnْqَrْغَaʾ", "root": "غرق"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بَعْدُ", "translit": "ُdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْبَاقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqāَbْlٱ", "root": "بقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 121, "text": "إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَءَايَةًۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكْثَرُهُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَءَl", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَكْثَرُهُم", "translit": "mُhُrَhtْkَaʾ", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُّm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 122, "text": "وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ ", "translation": "And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translit": "ُzyِzَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِḥَّrlٱ", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 123, "text": "كَذَّبَتْ عَادٌ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ ", "translation": "ʿAad denied the messengers", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كَذَّبَتْ", "translit": "ْtَbَّhdَk", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَادٌ", "translit": "ٌdāَʿع", "root": "عود"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَsْrُmْlٱ", "root": "رسل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 124, "text": "إِذْ قَالَ لَهُمْ أَخُوهُمْ هُودٌ أَلَا تَتَّقُونَ ", "translation": "When their brother Hūd said to them, \"Will you not fear Allāh?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَخُوهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhwُhkَaʾ", "root": "اخو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "هُودٌ", "translit": "ٌdwُh", "root": "هود"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَلَا", "translit": "āَlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تَتَّقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqَّtَt", "root": "وقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 125, "text": "إِنِّى لَكُمْ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٌ ", "translation": "Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَسُولٌ", "translit": "ٌlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَمِينٌ", "translit": "ٌnyِmَaʾ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 126, "text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ ", "translation": "So fear Allāh and obey me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَf", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَطِيعُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُʿعyِṭَaʾَw", "root": "طوع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 127, "text": "وَمَآ أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ أَجْرٍۖ إِنْ أَجْرِىَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُlَٔـْsَaʾ", "root": "سال"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِ", "translit": "ِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَجْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَجْرِىَ", "translit": "َàِrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 128, "text": "أَتَبْنُونَ بِكُلِّ رِيعٍ ءَايَةً تَعْبَثُونَ ", "translation": "Do you construct on every elevation a sign,[1] amusing yourselves,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَتَبْنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnْbَtَaʾ", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِكُلِّ", "translit": "ِّlُkِb", "root": "كلل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رِيعٍ", "translit": "ٍʿعyِr", "root": "ريع"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَعْبَثُونَ", "translit": "َnwُhtَbْʿعَt", "root": "عبث"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 129, "text": "وَتَتَّخِذُونَ مَصَانِعَ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَخْلُدُونَ ", "translation": "And take for yourselves constructions [i.e., palaces and fortresses] that you might abide eternally?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَتَتَّخِذُونَ", "translit": "َnwُhdِhkَّtَtَw", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَصَانِعَ", "translit": "َʿعِnāَṣَm", "root": "صنع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَّlَʿعَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَخْلُدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdُlْhkَt", "root": "خلد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 130, "text": "وَإِذَا بَطَشْتُم بَطَشْتُمْ جَبَّارِينَ ", "translation": "And when you strike, you strike as tyrants.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بَطَشْتُم", "translit": "mُtْhsَṭَb", "root": "بطش"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بَطَشْتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtْhsَṭَb", "root": "بطش"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "جَبَّارِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrāَّbَjg", "root": "جبر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 131, "text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ ", "translation": "So fear Allāh and obey me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَf", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَطِيعُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُʿعyِṭَaʾَw", "root": "طوع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 132, "text": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَمَدَّكُم بِمَا تَعْلَمُونَ ", "translation": "And fear He who provided you with that which you know,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَw", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَمَدَّكُم", "translit": "mُkَّdَmَaʾ", "root": "مدد"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَlْʿعَt", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 133, "text": "أَمَدَّكُم بِأَنْعَٰمٍ وَبَنِينَ ", "translation": "Provided you with grazing livestock and children", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَمَدَّكُم", "translit": "mُkَّdَmَaʾ", "root": "مدد"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِأَنْعَٰمٍ", "translit": "ٍmَٰʿعْnَaʾِb", "root": "نعم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَبَنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnَbَw", "root": "بني"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 134, "text": "وَجَنَّٰتٍ وَعُيُونٍ ", "translation": "And gardens and springs.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَجَنَّٰتٍ", "translit": "ٍtَّٰnَjgَw", "root": "جنن"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَعُيُونٍ", "translit": "ٍnwُyُʿعَw", "root": "عين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 135, "text": "إِنِّىٓ أَخَافُ عَلَيْكُمْ عَذَابَ يَوْمٍ عَظِيمٍ ", "translation": "Indeed, I fear for you the punishment of a terrible day.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَخَافُ", "translit": "ُfāَhkَaʾ", "root": "خوف"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "عَذَابَ", "translit": "َbāَhdَʿع", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَوْمٍ", "translit": "ٍmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "عَظِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِẓَʿع", "root": "عظم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 136, "text": "قَالُوا۟ سَوَآءٌ عَلَيْنَآ أَوَعَظْتَ أَمْ لَمْ تَكُن مِّنَ ٱلْوَٰعِظِينَ ", "translation": "They said, \"It is all the same to us whether you advise or are not of the advisors.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "سَوَآءٌ", "translit": "ٌءٓāَwَs", "root": "سوي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَيْنَآ", "translit": "ٓāَnْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَوَعَظْتَ", "translit": "َtْẓَʿعَwَaʾ", "root": "وعظ"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَمْ", "translit": "ْmَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَمْ", "translit": "ْmَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تَكُن", "translit": "nُkَt", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْوَٰعِظِينَ", "translit": "َnyِẓِʿعَٰwْlٱ", "root": "وعظ"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 137, "text": "إِنْ هَٰذَآ إِلَّا خُلُقُ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ ", "translation": "This is not but the custom of the former peoples,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هَٰذَآ", "translit": "ٓāَhdَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "خُلُقُ", "translit": "ُqُlُhk", "root": "خلق"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَّwَaʾْlٱ", "root": "اول"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 138, "text": "وَمَا نَحْنُ بِمُعَذَّبِينَ ", "translation": "And we are not to be punished.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَحْنُ", "translit": "ُnْḥَn", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِمُعَذَّبِينَ", "translit": "َnyِbَّhdَʿعُmِb", "root": "عذب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 139, "text": "فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَأَهْلَكْنَٰهُمْۗ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَءَايَةًۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكْثَرُهُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "And they denied him, so We destroyed them. Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَكَذَّبُوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُbَّhdَkَf", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فَأَهْلَكْنَٰهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَٰnْkَlْhَaʾَf", "root": "هلك"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَءَl", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَكْثَرُهُم", "translit": "mُhُrَhtْkَaʾ", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُّm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 140, "text": "وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ ", "translation": "And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translit": "ُzyِzَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِḥَّrlٱ", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 141, "text": "كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ ", "translation": "Thamūd denied the messengers", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كَذَّبَتْ", "translit": "ْtَbَّhdَk", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ثَمُودُ", "translit": "ُdwُmَht", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَsْrُmْlٱ", "root": "رسل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 142, "text": "إِذْ قَالَ لَهُمْ أَخُوهُمْ صَٰلِحٌ أَلَا تَتَّقُونَ ", "translation": "When their brother Ṣāliḥ said to them, \"Will you not fear Allāh?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَخُوهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhwُhkَaʾ", "root": "اخو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "صَٰلِحٌ", "translit": "ٌḥِlَٰṣ", "root": "صلح"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَلَا", "translit": "āَlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تَتَّقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqَّtَt", "root": "وقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 143, "text": "إِنِّى لَكُمْ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٌ ", "translation": "Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَسُولٌ", "translit": "ٌlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَمِينٌ", "translit": "ٌnyِmَaʾ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 144, "text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ ", "translation": "So fear Allāh and obey me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَf", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَطِيعُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُʿعyِṭَaʾَw", "root": "طوع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 145, "text": "وَمَآ أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ أَجْرٍۖ إِنْ أَجْرِىَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُlَٔـْsَaʾ", "root": "سال"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِ", "translit": "ِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَجْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَجْرِىَ", "translit": "َàِrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 146, "text": "أَتُتْرَكُونَ فِى مَا هَٰهُنَآ ءَامِنِينَ ", "translation": "Will you be left in what is here, secure [from death],", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَتُتْرَكُونَ", "translit": "َnwُkَrْtُtَaʾ", "root": "ترك"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "هَٰهُنَآ", "translit": "ٓāَnُhَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ءَامِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmāَء", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 147, "text": "فِى جَنَّٰتٍ وَعُيُونٍ ", "translation": "Within gardens and springs", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "جَنَّٰتٍ", "translit": "ٍtَّٰnَjg", "root": "جنن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَعُيُونٍ", "translit": "ٍnwُyُʿعَw", "root": "عين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 148, "text": "وَزُرُوعٍ وَنَخْلٍ طَلْعُهَا هَضِيمٌ ", "translation": "And fields of crops and palm trees with softened fruit?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَزُرُوعٍ", "translit": "ٍʿعwُrُzَw", "root": "زرع"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَنَخْلٍ", "translit": "ٍlْhkَnَw", "root": "نخل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "طَلْعُهَا", "translit": "āَhُʿعْlَṭ", "root": "طلع"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "هَضِيمٌ", "translit": "ٌmyِḍَh", "root": "هضم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 149, "text": "وَتَنْحِتُونَ مِنَ ٱلْجِبَالِ بُيُوتًا فَٰرِهِينَ ", "translation": "And you carve out of the mountains, homes, with skill.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَتَنْحِتُونَ", "translit": "َnwُtِḥْnَtَw", "root": "نحت"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْجِبَالِ", "translit": "ِlāَbِjgْlٱ", "root": "جبل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بُيُوتًا", "translit": "āًtwُyُb", "root": "بيت"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "فَٰرِهِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhِrَٰf", "root": "فره"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 150, "text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ ", "translation": "So fear Allāh and obey me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَf", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَطِيعُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُʿعyِṭَaʾَw", "root": "طوع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 151, "text": "وَلَا تُطِيعُوٓا۟ أَمْرَ ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ ", "translation": "And do not obey the order of the transgressors,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تُطِيعُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُʿعyِṭُt", "root": "طوع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَمْرَ", "translit": "َrْmَaʾ", "root": "امر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ", "translit": "َnyِfِrْsُmْlٱ", "root": "سرف"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 152, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ يُفْسِدُونَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَلَا يُصْلِحُونَ ", "translation": "Who cause corruption in the land and do not amend.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يُفْسِدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdِsْfُy", "root": "فسد"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْrَaʾْlٱ", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يُصْلِحُونَ", "translit": "َnwُḥِlْṣُy", "root": "صلح"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 153, "text": "قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مِنَ ٱلْمُسَحَّرِينَ ", "translation": "They said, \"You are only of those affected by magic.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِنَّمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَنتَ", "translit": "َtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْمُسَحَّرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrَّḥَsُmْlٱ", "root": "سحر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 154, "text": "مَآ أَنتَ إِلَّا بَشَرٌ مِّثْلُنَا فَأْتِ بِـَٔايَةٍ إِن كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلصَّٰدِقِينَ ", "translation": "You are but a man like ourselves, so bring a sign, if you should be of the truthful.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "مَآ", "translit": "ٓāَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَنتَ", "translit": "َtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بَشَرٌ", "translit": "ٌrَhsَb", "root": "بشر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِّثْلُنَا", "translit": "āَnُlْhtِّm", "root": "مثل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "فَأْتِ", "translit": "ِtْaʾَf", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "بِـَٔايَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَyāَٔـِb", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "كُنتَ", "translit": "َtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلصَّٰدِقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqِdَّٰṣlٱ", "root": "صدق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 155, "text": "قَالَ هَٰذِهِۦ نَاقَةٌ لَّهَا شِرْبٌ وَلَكُمْ شِرْبُ يَوْمٍ مَّعْلُومٍ ", "translation": "He said, \"This is a she-camel.[1] For her is a [time of] drink, and for you is a [time of] drink, [each] on a known day.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هَٰذِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِhdَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نَاقَةٌ", "translit": "ٌẗَqāَn", "root": "نوق"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَّهَا", "translit": "āَhَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "شِرْبٌ", "translit": "ٌbْrِhs", "root": "شرب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَلَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "شِرْبُ", "translit": "ُbْrِhs", "root": "شرب"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "يَوْمٍ", "translit": "ٍmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مَّعْلُومٍ", "translit": "ٍmwُlْʿعَّm", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 156, "text": "وَلَا تَمَسُّوهَا بِسُوٓءٍ فَيَأْخُذَكُمْ عَذَابُ يَوْمٍ عَظِيمٍ ", "translation": "And do not touch her with harm, lest you be seized by the punishment of a terrible day.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَمَسُّوهَا", "translit": "āَhwُّsَmَt", "root": "مسس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِسُوٓءٍ", "translit": "ٍءٓwُsِb", "root": "سوا"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَيَأْخُذَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَhdُhkْaʾَyَf", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "عَذَابُ", "translit": "ُbāَhdَʿع", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يَوْمٍ", "translit": "ٍmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "عَظِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِẓَʿع", "root": "عظم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 157, "text": "فَعَقَرُوهَا فَأَصْبَحُوا۟ نَٰدِمِينَ ", "translation": "But they hamstrung her and so became regretful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَعَقَرُوهَا", "translit": "āَhwُrَqَʿعَf", "root": "عقر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فَأَصْبَحُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُḥَbْṣَaʾَf", "root": "صبح"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نَٰدِمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmِdَٰn", "root": "ندم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 158, "text": "فَأَخَذَهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُۗ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَءَايَةًۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكْثَرُهُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "And the punishment seized them. Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَخَذَهُمُ", "translit": "ُmُhَhdَhkَaʾَf", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْعَذَابُ", "translit": "ُbāَhdَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَءَl", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَكْثَرُهُم", "translit": "mُhُrَhtْkَaʾ", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُّm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 159, "text": "وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ ", "translation": "And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translit": "ُzyِzَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِḥَّrlٱ", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 160, "text": "كَذَّبَتْ قَوْمُ لُوطٍ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ ", "translation": "The people of Lot denied the messengers", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كَذَّبَتْ", "translit": "ْtَbَّhdَk", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَوْمُ", "translit": "ُmْwَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لُوطٍ", "translit": "ٍṭwُl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَsْrُmْlٱ", "root": "رسل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 161, "text": "إِذْ قَالَ لَهُمْ أَخُوهُمْ لُوطٌ أَلَا تَتَّقُونَ ", "translation": "When their brother Lot said to them, \"Will you not fear Allāh?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَخُوهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhwُhkَaʾ", "root": "اخو"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "لُوطٌ", "translit": "ٌṭwُl", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَلَا", "translit": "āَlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تَتَّقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqَّtَt", "root": "وقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 162, "text": "إِنِّى لَكُمْ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٌ ", "translation": "Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَسُولٌ", "translit": "ٌlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَمِينٌ", "translit": "ٌnyِmَaʾ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 163, "text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ ", "translation": "So fear Allāh and obey me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَf", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَطِيعُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُʿعyِṭَaʾَw", "root": "طوع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 164, "text": "وَمَآ أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ أَجْرٍۖ إِنْ أَجْرِىَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُlَٔـْsَaʾ", "root": "سال"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِ", "translit": "ِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَجْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَجْرِىَ", "translit": "َàِrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 165, "text": "أَتَأْتُونَ ٱلذُّكْرَانَ مِنَ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "Do you approach males among the worlds[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَتَأْتُونَ", "translit": "َnwُtْaʾَtَaʾ", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلذُّكْرَانَ", "translit": "َnāَrْkُّhdlٱ", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 166, "text": "وَتَذَرُونَ مَا خَلَقَ لَكُمْ رَبُّكُم مِّنْ أَزْوَٰجِكُمۚ بَلْ أَنتُمْ قَوْمٌ عَادُونَ ", "translation": "And leave what your Lord has created for you as mates? But you are a people transgressing.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَتَذَرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrَhdَtَw", "root": "وذر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "خَلَقَ", "translit": "َqَlَhk", "root": "خلق"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "رَبُّكُم", "translit": "mُkُّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مِّنْ", "translit": "ْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَزْوَٰجِكُم", "translit": "mُkِjgَٰwْzَaʾ", "root": "زوج"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "بَلْ", "translit": "ْlَb", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "قَوْمٌ", "translit": "ٌmْwَq", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "عَادُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdāَʿع", "root": "عدو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 167, "text": "قَالُوا۟ لَئِن لَّمْ تَنتَهِ يَٰلُوطُ لَتَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلْمُخْرَجِينَ ", "translation": "They said, \"If you do not desist, O Lot, you will surely be of those evicted.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَئِن", "translit": "nِyʾَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَّمْ", "translit": "ْmَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَنتَهِ", "translit": "ِhَtnَt", "root": "نهي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَٰلُوطُ", "translit": "ُṭwُlَٰy", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَتَكُونَنَّ", "translit": "َّnَnwُkَtَl", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلْمُخْرَجِينَ", "translit": "َnyِjgَrْhkُmْlٱ", "root": "خرج"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 168, "text": "قَالَ إِنِّى لِعَمَلِكُم مِّنَ ٱلْقَالِينَ ", "translation": "He said, \"Indeed, I am, toward your deed, of those who detest [it].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِعَمَلِكُم", "translit": "mُkِlَmَʿعِl", "root": "عمل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْقَالِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlāَqْlٱ", "root": "قلي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 169, "text": "رَبِّ نَجِّنِى وَأَهْلِى مِمَّا يَعْمَلُونَ ", "translation": "My Lord, save me and my family from [the consequence of] what they do.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَجِّنِى", "translit": "àِnِّjgَn", "root": "نجو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَهْلِى", "translit": "àِlْhَaʾَw", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِمَّا", "translit": "āَّmِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَعْمَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَmْʿعَy", "root": "عمل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 170, "text": "فَنَجَّيْنَٰهُ وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ أَجْمَعِينَ ", "translation": "So We saved him and his family, all,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَنَجَّيْنَٰهُ", "translit": "ُhَٰnْyَّjgَnَf", "root": "نجو"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ", "translit": "ٓۥُhَlْhَaʾَw", "root": "اهل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَجْمَعِينَ", "translit": "َnyِʿعَmْjgَaʾ", "root": "جمع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 171, "text": "إِلَّا عَجُوزًا فِى ٱلْغَٰبِرِينَ ", "translation": "Except an old woman[1] among those who remained behind.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَجُوزًا", "translit": "āًzwُjgَʿع", "root": "عجز"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْغَٰبِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِbَٰغْlٱ", "root": "غبر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 172, "text": "ثُمَّ دَمَّرْنَا ٱلْءَاخَرِينَ ", "translation": "Then We destroyed the others.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "دَمَّرْنَا", "translit": "āَnْrَّmَd", "root": "دمر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْءَاخَرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrَhkāَءْlٱ", "root": "اخر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 173, "text": "وَأَمْطَرْنَا عَلَيْهِم مَّطَرًاۖ فَسَآءَ مَطَرُ ٱلْمُنذَرِينَ ", "translation": "And We rained upon them a rain [of stones], and evil was the rain of those who were warned.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَمْطَرْنَا", "translit": "āَnْrَṭْmَaʾَw", "root": "مطر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِم", "translit": "mِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَّطَرًا", "translit": "āًrَṭَّm", "root": "مطر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فَسَآءَ", "translit": "َءٓāَsَf", "root": "سوا"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مَطَرُ", "translit": "ُrَṭَm", "root": "مطر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْمُنذَرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrَhdnُmْlٱ", "root": "نذر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 174, "text": "إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَءَايَةًۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكْثَرُهُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَءَl", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَكْثَرُهُم", "translit": "mُhُrَhtْkَaʾ", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُّm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 175, "text": "وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ ", "translation": "And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translit": "ُzyِzَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِḥَّrlٱ", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 176, "text": "كَذَّبَ أَصْحَٰبُ لْـَٔيْكَةِ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ ", "translation": "The companions of the thicket [i.e., the people of Madyan] denied the messengers", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كَذَّبَ", "translit": "َbَّhdَk", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَصْحَٰبُ", "translit": "ُbَٰḥْṣَaʾ", "root": "صحب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لْـَٔيْكَةِ", "translit": "ِẗَkْyَٔـْl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَsْrُmْlٱ", "root": "رسل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 177, "text": "إِذْ قَالَ لَهُمْ شُعَيْبٌ أَلَا تَتَّقُونَ ", "translation": "When Shuʿayb said to them, \"Will you not fear Allāh?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "شُعَيْبٌ", "translit": "ٌbْyَʿعُhs", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَلَا", "translit": "āَlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَتَّقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqَّtَt", "root": "وقي"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 178, "text": "إِنِّى لَكُمْ رَسُولٌ أَمِينٌ ", "translation": "Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَسُولٌ", "translit": "ٌlwُsَr", "root": "رسل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَمِينٌ", "translit": "ٌnyِmَaʾ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 179, "text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُونِ ", "translation": "So fear Allāh and obey me.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَf", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَطِيعُونِ", "translit": "ِnwُʿعyِṭَaʾَw", "root": "طوع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 180, "text": "وَمَآ أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ أَجْرٍۖ إِنْ أَجْرِىَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُlَٔـْsَaʾ", "root": "سال"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِ", "translit": "ِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَجْرٍ", "translit": "ٍrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَجْرِىَ", "translit": "َàِrْjgَaʾ", "root": "اجر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 181, "text": "أَوْفُوا۟ ٱلْكَيْلَ وَلَا تَكُونُوا۟ مِنَ ٱلْمُخْسِرِينَ ", "translation": "Give full measure and do not be of those who cause loss.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَوْفُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُfْwَaʾ", "root": "وفي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْكَيْلَ", "translit": "َlْyَkْlٱ", "root": "كيل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَكُونُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnwُkَt", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْمُخْسِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِsْhkُmْlٱ", "root": "خسر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 182, "text": "وَزِنُوا۟ بِٱلْقِسْطَاسِ ٱلْمُسْتَقِيمِ ", "translation": "And weigh with an even [i.e., honest] balance.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَزِنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnِzَw", "root": "وزن"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِٱلْقِسْطَاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَṭْsِqْlٱِb", "root": "قسطس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْمُسْتَقِيمِ", "translit": "ِmyِqَtْsُmْlٱ", "root": "قوم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 183, "text": "وَلَا تَبْخَسُوا۟ ٱلنَّاسَ أَشْيَآءَهُمْ وَلَا تَعْثَوْا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ مُفْسِدِينَ ", "translation": "And do not deprive people of their due and do not commit abuse on earth, spreading corruption.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَبْخَسُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُsَhkْbَt", "root": "بخس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "translit": "َsāَّnlٱ", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَشْيَآءَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَءٓāَyْhsَaʾ", "root": "شيا"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "تَعْثَوْا۟", "translit": "۟āْwَhtْʿعَt", "root": "عثو"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْrَaʾْlٱ", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مُفْسِدِينَ", "translit": "َnyِdِsْfُm", "root": "فسد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 184, "text": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكُمْ وَٱلْجِبِلَّةَ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ ", "translation": "And fear He who created you and the former creation.\"[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَّtٱَw", "root": "وقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِى", "translit": "àِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "خَلَقَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَqَlَhk", "root": "خلق"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَٱلْجِبِلَّةَ", "translit": "َẗَّlِbِjgْlٱَw", "root": "جبل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَّwَaʾْlٱ", "root": "اول"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 185, "text": "قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مِنَ ٱلْمُسَحَّرِينَ ", "translation": "They said, \"You are only of those affected by magic.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِنَّمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَنتَ", "translit": "َtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْمُسَحَّرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrَّḥَsُmْlٱ", "root": "سحر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 186, "text": "وَمَآ أَنتَ إِلَّا بَشَرٌ مِّثْلُنَا وَإِن نَّظُنُّكَ لَمِنَ ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ ", "translation": "You are but a man like ourselves, and indeed, we think you are among the liars.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَنتَ", "translit": "َtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بَشَرٌ", "translit": "ٌrَhsَb", "root": "بشر"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِّثْلُنَا", "translit": "āَnُlْhtِّm", "root": "مثل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَإِن", "translit": "nِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "نَّظُنُّكَ", "translit": "َkُّnُẓَّn", "root": "ظنن"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "لَمِنَ", "translit": "َnِmَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ", "translit": "َnyِbِhdَٰkْlٱ", "root": "كذب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 187, "text": "فَأَسْقِطْ عَلَيْنَا كِسَفًا مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ إِن كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلصَّٰدِقِينَ ", "translation": "So cause to fall upon us fragments of the sky, if you should be of the truthful.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَأَسْقِطْ", "translit": "ْṭِqْsَaʾَf", "root": "سقط"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَيْنَا", "translit": "āَnْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كِسَفًا", "translit": "āًfَsِk", "root": "كسف"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِّنَ", "translit": "َnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَmَّslٱ", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "كُنتَ", "translit": "َtnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلصَّٰدِقِينَ", "translit": "َnyِqِdَّٰṣlٱ", "root": "صدق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 188, "text": "قَالَ رَبِّىٓ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ ", "translation": "He said, \"My Lord is most knowing of what you do.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "قَالَ", "translit": "َlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبِّىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَعْلَمُ", "translit": "ُmَlْʿعَaʾ", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَmْʿعَt", "root": "عمل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 189, "text": "فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَأَخَذَهُمْ عَذَابُ يَوْمِ ٱلظُّلَّةِۚ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ عَذَابَ يَوْمٍ عَظِيمٍ ", "translation": "And they denied him, so the punishment of the day of the black cloud seized them. Indeed, it was the punishment of a terrible day.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَكَذَّبُوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُbَّhdَkَf", "root": "كذب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فَأَخَذَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَhdَhkَaʾَf", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَذَابُ", "translit": "ُbāَhdَʿع", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَوْمِ", "translit": "ِmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلظُّلَّةِ", "translit": "ِẗَّlُّẓlٱ", "root": "ظلل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "عَذَابَ", "translit": "َbāَhdَʿع", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "يَوْمٍ", "translit": "ٍmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عَظِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِẓَʿع", "root": "عظم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 190, "text": "إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَءَايَةًۖ وَمَا كَانَ أَكْثَرُهُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَءَl", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَكْثَرُهُم", "translit": "mُhُrَhtْkَaʾ", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُّm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 191, "text": "وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ ", "translation": "And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّ", "translit": "َّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "رَبَّكَ", "translit": "َkَّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translit": "ُzyِzَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِḥَّrlٱ", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 192, "text": "وَإِنَّهُۥ لَتَنزِيلُ رَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ", "translation": "And indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is the revelation of the Lord of the worlds.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَتَنزِيلُ", "translit": "ُlyِznَtَl", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَبِّ", "translit": "ِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَlَٰʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 193, "text": "نَزَلَ بِهِ ٱلرُّوحُ ٱلْأَمِينُ ", "translation": "The Trustworthy Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] has brought it down", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "نَزَلَ", "translit": "َlَzَn", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بِهِ", "translit": "ِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلرُّوحُ", "translit": "ُḥwُّrlٱ", "root": "روح"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْأَمِينُ", "translit": "ُnyِmَaʾْlٱ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 194, "text": "عَلَىٰ قَلْبِكَ لِتَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلْمُنذِرِينَ ", "translation": "Upon your heart, [O Muḥammad] - that you may be of the warners", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "قَلْبِكَ", "translit": "َkِbْlَq", "root": "قلب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِتَكُونَ", "translit": "َnwُkَtِl", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْمُنذِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِhdnُmْlٱ", "root": "نذر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 195, "text": "بِلِسَانٍ عَرَبِىٍّ مُّبِينٍ ", "translation": "In a clear Arabic language.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "بِلِسَانٍ", "translit": "ٍnāَsِlِb", "root": "لسن"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَرَبِىٍّ", "translit": "ٍّàِbَrَʿع", "root": "عرب"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مُّبِينٍ", "translit": "ٍnyِbُّm", "root": "بين"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 196, "text": "وَإِنَّهُۥ لَفِى زُبُرِ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ ", "translation": "And indeed, it is [mentioned] in the scriptures of former peoples.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَفِى", "translit": "àِfَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "زُبُرِ", "translit": "ِrُbُz", "root": "زبر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ", "translit": "َnyِlَّwَaʾْlٱ", "root": "اول"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 197, "text": "أَوَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُمْ ءَايَةً أَن يَعْلَمَهُۥ عُلَمَٰٓؤُا۟ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ", "translation": "And has it not been a sign to them that it is recognized by the scholars of the Children of Israel?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَوَلَمْ", "translit": "ْmَlَwَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَكُن", "translit": "nُkَy", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ءَايَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyāَء", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يَعْلَمَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَmَlْʿعَy", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "عُلَمَٰٓؤُا۟", "translit": "۟āُwʾَٰٓmَlُʿع", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "بَنِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِnَb", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِءَٰٓrْsِiʾ", "root": ""}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 198, "text": "وَلَوْ نَزَّلْنَٰهُ عَلَىٰ بَعْضِ ٱلْأَعْجَمِينَ ", "translation": "And even if We had revealed it to one among the foreigners[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَلَوْ", "translit": "ْwَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "نَزَّلْنَٰهُ", "translit": "ُhَٰnْlَّzَn", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بَعْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْʿعَb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْأَعْجَمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmَjgْʿعَaʾْlٱ", "root": "عجم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 199, "text": "فَقَرَأَهُۥ عَلَيْهِم مَّا كَانُوا۟ بِهِۦ مُؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "And he had recited it to them [perfectly],[1] they would [still] not have been believers in it.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَقَرَأَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَaʾَrَqَf", "root": "قرا"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِم", "translit": "mِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَّا", "translit": "āَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "كَانُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مُؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُm", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 200, "text": "كَذَٰلِكَ سَلَكْنَٰهُ فِى قُلُوبِ ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ ", "translation": "Thus have We inserted it [i.e., disbelief] into the hearts of the criminals.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translit": "َkِlَٰhdَk", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "سَلَكْنَٰهُ", "translit": "ُhَٰnْkَlَs", "root": "سلك"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قُلُوبِ", "translit": "ِbwُlُq", "root": "قلب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmِrْjgُmْlٱ", "root": "جرم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 201, "text": "لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِهِۦ حَتَّىٰ يَرَوُا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ ٱلْأَلِيمَ ", "translation": "They will not believe in it until they see the painful punishment.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnِmْwʾُy", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "حَتَّىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَّtَḥ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَرَوُا۟", "translit": "۟āُwَrَy", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْعَذَابَ", "translit": "َbāَhdَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْأَلِيمَ", "translit": "َmyِlَaʾْlٱ", "root": "الم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 202, "text": "فَيَأْتِيَهُم بَغْتَةً وَهُمْ لَا يَشْعُرُونَ ", "translation": "And it will come to them suddenly while they perceive [it] not.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَيَأْتِيَهُم", "translit": "mُhَyِtْaʾَyَf", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "بَغْتَةً", "translit": "ًẗَtْغَb", "root": "بغت"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَشْعُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُʿعْhsَy", "root": "شعر"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 203, "text": "فَيَقُولُوا۟ هَلْ نَحْنُ مُنظَرُونَ ", "translation": "And they will say, \"May we be reprieved?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَيَقُولُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlwُqَyَf", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هَلْ", "translit": "ْlَh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نَحْنُ", "translit": "ُnْḥَn", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مُنظَرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrَẓnُm", "root": "نظر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 204, "text": "أَفَبِعَذَابِنَا يَسْتَعْجِلُونَ ", "translation": "So for Our punishment are they impatient?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَفَبِعَذَابِنَا", "translit": "āَnِbāَhdَʿعِbَfَaʾ", "root": "عذب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَسْتَعْجِلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlِjgْʿعَtْsَy", "root": "عجل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 205, "text": "أَفَرَءَيْتَ إِن مَّتَّعْنَٰهُمْ سِنِينَ ", "translation": "Then have you considered if We gave them enjoyment for years", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَفَرَءَيْتَ", "translit": "َtْyَءَrَfَaʾ", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَّتَّعْنَٰهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَٰnْʿعَّtَّm", "root": "متع"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "سِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِs", "root": "سنو"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 206, "text": "ثُمَّ جَآءَهُم مَّا كَانُوا۟ يُوعَدُونَ ", "translation": "And then there came to them that which they were promised?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "جَآءَهُم", "translit": "mُhَءٓāَjg", "root": "جيا"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَّا", "translit": "āَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "كَانُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يُوعَدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdَʿعwُy", "root": "وعد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 207, "text": "مَآ أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُم مَّا كَانُوا۟ يُمَتَّعُونَ ", "translation": "They would not be availed by the enjoyment with which they were provided.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "مَآ", "translit": "ٓāَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَغْنَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَnْغَaʾ", "root": "غني"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَنْهُم", "translit": "mُhْnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَّا", "translit": "āَّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كَانُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "يُمَتَّعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعَّtَmُy", "root": "متع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 208, "text": "وَمَآ أَهْلَكْنَا مِن قَرْيَةٍ إِلَّا لَهَا مُنذِرُونَ ", "translation": "And We did not destroy any city except that it had warners", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَهْلَكْنَا", "translit": "āَnْkَlْhَaʾ", "root": "هلك"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قَرْيَةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَyْrَq", "root": "قري"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَهَا", "translit": "āَhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مُنذِرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrِhdnُm", "root": "نذر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 209, "text": "ذِكْرَىٰ وَمَا كُنَّا ظَٰلِمِينَ ", "translation": "As a reminder; and never have We been unjust.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ذِكْرَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَrْkِhd", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كُنَّا", "translit": "āَّnُk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ظَٰلِمِينَ", "translit": "َnyِmِlَٰẓ", "root": "ظلم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 210, "text": "وَمَا تَنَزَّلَتْ بِهِ ٱلشَّيَٰطِينُ ", "translation": "And the devils have not brought it [i.e., the revelation] down.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَنَزَّلَتْ", "translit": "ْtَlَّzَnَt", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِهِ", "translit": "ِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلشَّيَٰطِينُ", "translit": "ُnyِṭَٰyَّhslٱ", "root": "شطن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 211, "text": "وَمَا يَنۢبَغِى لَهُمْ وَمَا يَسْتَطِيعُونَ ", "translation": "It is not allowable for them, nor would they be able.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَنۢبَغِى", "translit": "àِغَbۢnَy", "root": "بغي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَسْتَطِيعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعyِṭَtْsَy", "root": "طوع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 212, "text": "إِنَّهُمْ عَنِ ٱلسَّمْعِ لَمَعْزُولُونَ ", "translation": "Indeed they, from [its] hearing, are removed.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَنِ", "translit": "ِnَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمْعِ", "translit": "ِʿعْmَّslٱ", "root": "سمع"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَمَعْزُولُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlwُzْʿعَmَl", "root": "عزل"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 213, "text": "فَلَا تَدْعُ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ إِلَٰهًا ءَاخَرَ فَتَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلْمُعَذَّبِينَ ", "translation": "So do not invoke[1] with Allāh another deity and [thus] be among the punished.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلَا", "translit": "āَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَدْعُ", "translit": "ُʿعْdَt", "root": "دعو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَعَ", "translit": "َʿعَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِلَٰهًا", "translit": "āًhَٰlِiʾ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ءَاخَرَ", "translit": "َrَhkāَء", "root": "اخر"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَتَكُونَ", "translit": "َnwُkَtَf", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱلْمُعَذَّبِينَ", "translit": "َnyِbَّhdَʿعُmْlٱ", "root": "عذب"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 214, "text": "وَأَنذِرْ عَشِيرَتَكَ ٱلْأَقْرَبِينَ ", "translation": "And warn, [O Muḥammad], your closest kindred.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَنذِرْ", "translit": "ْrِhdnَaʾَw", "root": "نذر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَشِيرَتَكَ", "translit": "َkَtَryِhsَʿع", "root": "عشر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْأَقْرَبِينَ", "translit": "َnyِbَrْqَaʾْlٱ", "root": "قرب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 215, "text": "وَٱخْفِضْ جَنَاحَكَ لِمَنِ ٱتَّبَعَكَ مِنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ", "translation": "And lower your wing [i.e., show kindness] to those who follow you of the believers.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱخْفِضْ", "translit": "ْḍِfْhkٱَw", "root": "خفض"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "جَنَاحَكَ", "translit": "َkَḥāَnَjg", "root": "جنح"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِمَنِ", "translit": "ِnَmِl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱتَّبَعَكَ", "translit": "َkَʿعَbَّtٱ", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "مِنَ", "translit": "َnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translit": "َnyِnِmْwʾُmْlٱ", "root": "امن"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 216, "text": "فَإِنْ عَصَوْكَ فَقُلْ إِنِّى بَرِىٓءٌ مِّمَّا تَعْمَلُونَ ", "translation": "And if they disobey you, then say, \"Indeed, I am disassociated from what you are doing.\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَإِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَصَوْكَ", "translit": "َkْwَṣَʿع", "root": "عصي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَقُلْ", "translit": "ْlُqَf", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "إِنِّى", "translit": "àِّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بَرِىٓءٌ", "translit": "ٌءٓàِrَb", "root": "برا"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مِّمَّا", "translit": "āَّmِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَmْʿعَt", "root": "عمل"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 217, "text": "وَتَوَكَّلْ عَلَى ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ", "translation": "And rely upon the Exalted in Might, the Merciful,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَتَوَكَّلْ", "translit": "ْlَّkَwَtَw", "root": "وكل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْعَزِيزِ", "translit": "ِzyِzَʿعْlٱ", "root": "عزز"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلرَّحِيمِ", "translit": "ِmyِḥَّrlٱ", "root": "رحم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 218, "text": "ٱلَّذِى يَرَىٰكَ حِينَ تَقُومُ ", "translation": "Who sees you when you arise[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِى", "translit": "àِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَرَىٰكَ", "translit": "َkٰàَrَy", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "حِينَ", "translit": "َnyِḥ", "root": "حين"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَقُومُ", "translit": "ُmwُqَt", "root": "قوم"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 219, "text": "وَتَقَلُّبَكَ فِى ٱلسَّٰجِدِينَ ", "translation": "And your movement among those who prostrate.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَتَقَلُّبَكَ", "translit": "َkَbُّlَqَtَw", "root": "قلب"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلسَّٰجِدِينَ", "translit": "َnyِdِjgَّٰslٱ", "root": "سجد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 220, "text": "إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ ", "translation": "Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Knowing.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمِيعُ", "translit": "ُʿعyِmَّslٱ", "root": "سمع"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْعَلِيمُ", "translit": "ُmyِlَʿعْlٱ", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 221, "text": "هَلْ أُنَبِّئُكُمْ عَلَىٰ مَن تَنَزَّلُ ٱلشَّيَٰطِينُ ", "translation": "Shall I inform you upon whom the devils descend?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "هَلْ", "translit": "ْlَh", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أُنَبِّئُكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkُyʾِّbَnُaʾ", "root": "نبا"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مَن", "translit": "nَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَنَزَّلُ", "translit": "ُlَّzَnَt", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ٱلشَّيَٰطِينُ", "translit": "ُnyِṭَٰyَّhslٱ", "root": "شطن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 222, "text": "تَنَزَّلُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ أَفَّاكٍ أَثِيمٍ ", "translation": "They descend upon every sinful liar.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "تَنَزَّلُ", "translit": "ُlَّzَnَt", "root": "نزل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كُلِّ", "translit": "ِّlُk", "root": "كلل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَفَّاكٍ", "translit": "ٍkāَّfَaʾ", "root": "افك"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَثِيمٍ", "translit": "ٍmyِhtَaʾ", "root": "اثم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 223, "text": "يُلْقُونَ ٱلسَّمْعَ وَأَكْثَرُهُمْ كَٰذِبُونَ ", "translation": "They pass on what is heard,[1] and most of them are liars.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يُلْقُونَ", "translit": "َnwُqْlُy", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلسَّمْعَ", "translit": "َʿعْmَّslٱ", "root": "سمع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَأَكْثَرُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُrَhtْkَaʾَw", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "كَٰذِبُونَ", "translit": "َnwُbِhdَٰk", "root": "كذب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 224, "text": "وَٱلشُّعَرَآءُ يَتَّبِعُهُمُ ٱلْغَاوُۥنَ ", "translation": "And the poets - [only] the deviators follow them.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلشُّعَرَآءُ", "translit": "ُءٓāَrَʿعُّhslٱَw", "root": "شعر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَتَّبِعُهُمُ", "translit": "ُmُhُʿعِbَّtَy", "root": "تبع"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلْغَاوُۥنَ", "translit": "َnۥُwāَغْlٱ", "root": "غوي"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 225, "text": "أَلَمْ تَرَ أَنَّهُمْ فِى كُلِّ وَادٍ يَهِيمُونَ ", "translation": "Do you not see that in every valley they roam[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَلَمْ", "translit": "ْmَlَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تَرَ", "translit": "َrَt", "root": "راي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَنَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فِى", "translit": "àِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "كُلِّ", "translit": "ِّlُk", "root": "كلل"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَادٍ", "translit": "ٍdāَw", "root": "ودي"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يَهِيمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmyِhَy", "root": "هيم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 226, "text": "وَأَنَّهُمْ يَقُولُونَ مَا لَا يَفْعَلُونَ ", "translation": "And that they say what they do not do? -", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَنَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَقُولُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlwُqَy", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَفْعَلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlَʿعْfَy", "root": "فعل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 227, "text": "إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ وَذَكَرُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ كَثِيرًا وَٱنتَصَرُوا۟ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا ظُلِمُوا۟ۗ وَسَيَعْلَمُ ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوٓا۟ أَىَّ مُنقَلَبٍ يَنقَلِبُونَ ", "translation": "Except those [poets] who believe and do righteous deeds and remember Allāh often and defend [the Muslims][1] after they were wronged. And those who have wronged are going to know to what [kind of] return they will be returned.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَعَمِلُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlِmَʿعَw", "root": "عمل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰḥِlَّٰṣlٱ", "root": "صلح"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَذَكَرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrَkَhdَw", "root": "ذكر"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "كَثِيرًا", "translit": "āًryِhtَk", "root": "كثر"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "وَٱنتَصَرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrَṣَtnٱَw", "root": "نصر"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مِنۢ", "translit": "ۢnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "بَعْدِ", "translit": "ِdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ظُلِمُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُmِlُẓ", "root": "ظلم"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَسَيَعْلَمُ", "translit": "ُmَlْʿعَyَsَw", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "ظَلَمُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُmَlَẓ", "root": "ظلم"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "أَىَّ", "translit": "َّàَaʾ", "root": "ايي"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "مُنقَلَبٍ", "translit": "ٍbَlَqnُm", "root": "قلب"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "يَنقَلِبُونَ", "translit": "َnwُbِlَqnَy", "root": "قلب"}], "hasIhya": false}], "tafsir": {"12": [{"arabic": "فكذلك الانبساط والإدلال يحتمل من بعض العباد دون بعض. فمن انبساط الأنس قول موسى عليه السلام: \"إن هي إلا فتنتك تضل بها من تشاء وتهدي من تشاء\" وقوله في التعليل والاعتذار لما قيل له: \"اذهب إلى فرعون\"، فقال: \"ولهم على ذنب\" وقوله: \"إني أخاف أن يكذبون ويضيق صدري ولا ينطلق لساني\"، وقوله: \"إننا نخاف أن يفرط علينا أو أن يطغى\" وهذا من غير موسى عليه السلام من سوء الأدب لأن الذي أقيم مقام الأنس يلاطف ويحتمل، ولم يحتمل ليونس عليه السلام ما دون هذا لما أقيم مقام القبض والهيبة، فعوقب بالسجن في بطن الحوت - في ظل", "english": "Similarly, expansion (Inbisat) and familiarity (Idlal) are permissible for some worshippers but not others. Among the expansion of intimacy (Unsi) is the saying of Moses, peace be upon him: \"It is only Your trial by which You misguide whom You will and guide whom You will\" and his saying in explanation and excuse when he was told: \"Go to Pharaoh,\" so he said: \"And they have upon me a sin\" and his saying: \"Indeed, I fear that they will deny me and my chest will tighten and my tongue will not be released\" and his saying: \"Indeed, we fear that he will hasten against us or that he will transgress.\" And this from other than Moses, peace be upon him, would be bad manners (Su' al-Adab) because the one who is established in the station of intimacy (Maqam al-Unsi) is indulged and tolerated, and it was not tolerated for Jonah, peace be upon him, what is less than this because he was established in the station of contraction (Maqam al-Qabd) and awe (Hibah), so he was punished with imprisonment in the belly of the whale - in three darknesses - and he was called out to until the Day of Resurrection: \"Had it not been that a favor from his Lord reached him, he would have been thrown onto the naked shore while he was blameworthy.\"", "book_file": "vol4_Vol4-book6.doc.txt", "book_title": "Love, Longing, Intimacy and Contentment", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Love, Longing, Intimacy and Contentment'", "badge": "Insight"}], "23": [{"arabic": "وقال تعالى في قصة فرعون وما رب العالمين إلى قوله أولوا جئتك بشيء مبين", "english": "And He (Allah) said in the story of Pharaoh: 'And what is the Lord (Rabb) of the worlds?' up to His saying: 'Would that you had come to me with something clear?'", "book_file": "vol1_Vol1-book-2.doc.txt", "book_title": "Foundations of Belief", "content_type": "general", "topic": "Commentary from Al-Ghazali's Ihya 'Ulum al-Din, from 'Foundations of Belief'", "badge": "General"}], "42": [{"arabic": "فالعلاج الاول يضاهي اطماع المصارع بالخلعة عند الغلبة ووعده بأنواع الكرامة كما وعد فرعون سحرته عند إغرائه اياهم بموسى حيث قال ﭬ ﴿ وانكم اذا لمن المقربين ﴾  {} والثاني يضاهي تعويد الصبي الذي يراد منه المصارعة والمقاتلة بمباشرة اسباب ذلك منذ الصبا حتى يأنس به ويستجرىء عليه وتقوى فيه منته", "english": "The first treatment resembles tempting the wrestler with the robe of honor upon victory and promising him various honors, as Pharaoh promised his magicians when enticing them against Moses, where He said: 'And indeed you will then be among those brought near (al-Muqarrabīn).' The second resembles habituating the child who is intended for wrestling and fighting by directly engaging in its causes from childhood until he becomes accustomed to it and becomes bold in it, and his strength in it increases.", "book_file": "vol4_Vol4-book2.doc.txt", "book_title": "Patience and Gratitude", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Patience and Gratitude'", "badge": "Insight"}], "49": [{"arabic": "وما مثال المكاشفين والمعتقدين إلا كسحرة فرعون مع أصحاب السامري؛ فإن سحرة فرعون لما كانوا مطلعين على منتهى تأثير السحر لطول مشاهدتهم وتجربتهم رأوا من موسى عليه السلام ما جاوز حدود السحر وانكشف لهم حقيقة الأمر فلم يكترثوا بقول فرعون \"لأقطعن أيديكم وأرجلكم من خلاف\" بل \"قالوا لن نؤثرك على ما جاءنا من البينات والذي فطرنا فاقض ما أنت قاض إنما تقضي هذه الحياة الدنيا\" فإن البيان والكشف يمنع التغيير وأما أصحاب السامري لما كان إيمانهم عن النظر إلى ظاهر الثعبان، فلما نظروا إلى عجل السامري وسمعوا خواره تغير", "english": "And the example of those who have spiritual unveiling (Mukāshifīn) and those who merely believe (Muʿtaqidīn) is nothing but like the magicians of Pharaoh with the companions of the Samiri; for the magicians of Pharaoh, since they were aware of the ultimate effect of magic due to their prolonged witnessing and experience, saw from Moses (peace be upon him) what exceeded the limits of magic and the truth of the matter was unveiled to them, so they did not heed Pharaoh's saying \"I will cut off your hands and your feet on opposite sides\" but rather \"they said: 'We will never prefer you over what has come to us of clear proofs and He who created us. So decree whatever you are to decree. You can only decree for this worldly life.'\" For clarity and unveiling prevent change. As for the companions of the Samiri, since their faith was from looking at the outward appearance of the serpent, when they looked at the calf of the Samiri and heard its lowing, they changed and heard his saying \"This is your god and the god of Moses\" and forgot that it does not respond to them with speech nor possesses for them harm or benefit: thus everyone who believes by looking at a serpent will inevitably disbelieve if he looks at a calf, because both are from the world of witnessing (ʿĀlam al-Shahādah) and difference and opposition in the world of witnessing is abundant. As for the world of the dominion (ʿĀlam al-Malakūt), it is from God the Exalted, therefore we do not find in it any difference or opposition at all.", "book_file": "vol4_Vol4-book5.doc.txt", "book_title": "Monotheism and Reliance", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Monotheism and Reliance'", "badge": "Insight"}], "80": [{"arabic": "الحمد لله المنفرد بالجلال في كبريائه وتعاليه، المستحق للتحميد والتقديس والتسبيح والتنزيه، القائم بالعدل فيما يبرمه ويقضيه، المتطول بالفضل فيما ينعم به ويسديه، المتكفل بحفظ عبده في جميع موارده ومجاريه، المنعم عليه بما يزيد على مهمات مقاصده بل بما يفي بأمانيه، فهو الذي يرشده ويهديه، وهو الذي يميتُه ويحييه، وإذا مرض فهو يشفيه، وإذا ضعف فهو يقويه، وهو الذي يوفقه للطاعة ويرتضيه، وهو الذي يطعمه ويسقيه، ويحفظه من الهلاك ويحميه، ويحرسه بالطعام والشراب عما يهلكه ويرديه، ويمكنه من القناعة بقليل القوت ويقر", "english": "Praise be to Allah, the One Alone in Majesty in His greatness and exaltation, deserving of praise, sanctification, glorification, and transcendence, the One who establishes justice in what He decrees and judges, the One who extends favor in what He bestows and grants, the One who undertakes the protection of His servant in all his sources and courses, the One who bestows upon him what exceeds the necessities of his aims but rather fulfills his hopes, so He is the One who guides him and directs him, and He is the One who causes him to die and gives him life, and when he is sick, He heals him, and when he is weak, He strengthens him, and He is the One who grants him success in obedience and approves of him, and He is the One who feeds him and gives him drink, and protects him from destruction and safeguards him, and guards him with food and drink from what destroys him and ruins him, and enables him with contentment with little sustenance and brings him near until the pathways of Satan who opposes him become narrow for him, and breaks with it the desire of the Soul (Nafs) which opposes him, so he repels its evil then worships his Lord and fears Him, this after He expands upon him what he delights in and desires, and increases upon him what stirs his motives and confirms his urges, all of that He tests him with and tries him, so He observes how he prefers it over what he loves and chooses, and how he preserves His commands and refrains from His prohibitions, and persists in His obedience and abstains from His disobedience.", "book_file": "vol3_Vol3-book3a.doc.txt", "book_title": "Harms of the Tongue", "content_type": "dhikr", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on the virtue and practice of remembering God, from 'Harms of the Tongue'", "badge": "Dhikr"}], "88": [{"arabic": "يوم لا ينطقون ولا يؤذن لهم فيعتذرون يوم لا مرد له من الله يوم هم بارزون ويوم هم على النار يفتنون يوم لا ينفع مال ولا بنون يوم لا ينفع الظالمين معذرتهم ولهم اللعنة ولهم سوء الدار يوم ترد فيه المعاذير وتبلى السرائر وتظهر الضمائر وتكشف الأستار يوم تخشع فيه الأبصار وتسكن الأصوات ويقل فيه الالتفات وتبرز الخفيات وتظهر الخطيئات يوم يساق العباد ومعهم الأشهاد ويشيب الصغير ويسكر الكبير فيومئذ وضعت الموازين ونشرت الدواوين وبرزت الجحيم وأغلى الحميم وزفرت النار ويئس الكفار وسعرت النيران وتغيرت الألوان وخرس ا", "english": "A day when they will not speak nor be permitted to offer excuses, a day when there is no turning back from Allah, a day when they are exposed, and a day when they are tested over the Fire, a day when wealth will not benefit nor children, a day when the excuses of the wrongdoers will not benefit them, and for them is the curse and for them is the evil abode, a day when excuses are returned, secrets are tested, consciences are revealed, and veils are uncovered, a day when gazes are humbled, voices are silenced, turning away is diminished, hidden things are exposed, and sins are made apparent, a day when the servants are driven forth with their witnesses, the young turn gray-haired, and the old become intoxicated. Then on that day, the scales are set up, the records are spread out, Hellfire is made manifest, the boiling water is heated, the Fire blazes, the disbelievers despair, the fires are kindled, colors change, the tongue is silenced, and the limbs of the human being speak. O human being, what has deluded you concerning your Generous Lord, when the doors are closed, the curtains are lowered, and you are concealed from the creatures, yet you commit immorality? So what will you do when your limbs bear witness against you? So woe, all woe to us, the heedless ones.", "book_file": "vol4_Vol4-book10.doc.txt", "book_title": "Book of Repentance", "content_type": "afterlife", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on death, the grave, and preparation for the Hereafter, from 'Book of Repentance'", "badge": "Afterlife"}], "89": [{"arabic": "وقد قرأ أبو سليمان قوله تعالى: \" إلا من أتى الله بقلبٍ سليم \" فقال: هو القلب الذي ليس فيه غير الله تعالى وقال: إنما زهدوا الدنيا لتفرغ قلوبهم من همومها للآخرة، فهذا بيان انقسام الزهد بالإضافة إلى أصناف المزهود فيه؛", "english": "And Abu Sulayman recited the saying of the Exalted: \"Except he who comes to Allah with a sound heart (Qalb Salim)\" and said: It is the heart (Qalb) in which there is nothing other than Allah the Exalted, and said: They only abstained from the world (Zuhd) to empty their hearts (Qalb) from its concerns for the Hereafter (Akhirah), and this is an explanation of the division of abstention (Zuhd) in relation to the categories of what is abstained from;", "book_file": "vol4_Vol4-book4.doc.txt", "book_title": "Poverty and Abstinence", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Poverty and Abstinence'", "badge": "Insight"}], "202": [{"arabic": "الحمد لله الذي لا يتكل على عفوه ورحمته إلا الراجون، ولا يحذر سوء غضبه وسطوته إلا الخائفون، الذي استدرج عباده من حيث لا يعلمون، وسلط عليهم الشهوات وأمرهم بترك ما يشتهون، وابتلاهم بالغضب وكلفهم كظم الغيظ فيما يغضبون، ثم حفهم بالمكاره واللذات وأملى لهم لينظر كيف يعملون، وامتحن بهم حبهم ليعلم صدقهم فيما يدعون، وعرفهم أنه لا يخفى عليه شيء مما يسرون وما يعلنون، وحذرهم أن يأخذهم بغتة وهم لا يشعرون فقال \"ما ينظرون إلا صيحة واحدة تأخذهم وهم يخصمون فلا يستطيعون توصية ولا إلى أهلهم يرجعون\" والصلاة والسلام ", "english": "Praise be to Allah, upon whose forgiveness (ʿafw) and mercy (raḥmah) none rely except the hopeful (al-rājūn), and none fear the evil of His anger (ghaḍab) and His might except the fearful (al-khāʾifūn), who leads His servants astray from where they do not know, and subjects them to desires (shahawāt) and commands them to abandon what they desire, and tests them with anger (ghaḍab) and obliges them to suppress rage (kaẓm al-ghayẓ) in what angers them, then surrounds them with hardships and pleasures and grants them respite to see how they act, and tests them with their love to know their truthfulness in what they claim, and makes known to them that nothing is hidden from Him of what they conceal and what they reveal, and warns them that He may seize them suddenly while they are unaware, saying: \"They await not but a single blast which will seize them while they are disputing. Then they will not be able to make a bequest, nor will they return to their families.\" And prayers and peace be upon Muhammad, His messenger, under whose banner the prophets march, and upon his family and his companions, the guided leaders (al-aʾimmah al-mahdiyyīn), and the pleased masters (al-sādah al-marḍiyyīn), prayers equal in number to what has been of Allah's creation and what will be, and may the first and the last attain its blessing, and grant abundant peace.", "book_file": "vol3_Vol3-book5a.doc.txt", "book_title": "Condemnation of Envy", "content_type": "ethics", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on the diseases of the heart and their cure, from 'Condemnation of Envy'", "badge": "Ethics"}], "212": [{"arabic": "وأما الجاحدون والغافلون والمغترون بلامع السراب من زهرة الدنيا فإنهم لا يبصرون ولا يسمعون لأنهم عن السمع معزولون وعن آيات ربهم محجوبون يعلمون ظاهرا من الحياة الدنيا وهم عن الآخرة هم غافلون وما أريد بالسمع السمع الظاهر فإن الذين أريدوا به ما كانوا معزولين عنه وإنما أريد به السمع الباطن ولا يدرك بالسمع الظاهر إلا الأصوات ويشارك الإنسان فيه سائر الحيوانات فأما السمع الباطن فيدرك به لسان الحال الذي هو نطق وراء نطق المقال", "english": "As for the deniers (al-Jāhidūn) and the heedless (al-Ghāfilūn) and those deceived by the shimmering mirage of the world's adornment, they do not see and they do not hear because they are prevented from hearing (maʿzūlūn ʿan al-samʿ) and veiled from the signs of their Lord. They know the outward aspect of worldly life, and they are heedless of the Hereafter. And what is intended by 'hearing' is not the outward hearing, for those intended by it were not prevented from that. Rather, what is intended is the inward hearing (al-samʿ al-bāṭin). With the outward hearing, only sounds are perceived, and in this, humans share with all other animals. As for the inward hearing, through it is perceived the language of the state (lisān al-ḥāl), which is an utterance beyond the utterance of speech.", "book_file": "vol2_j2-k07.doc.txt", "book_title": "Etiquette of Travel", "content_type": "ethics", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on the diseases of the heart and their cure, from 'Etiquette of Travel'", "badge": "Ethics"}], "213": [{"arabic": "وقال ﭬ \"يخرج من النار عنق له أذنان تسمعان وعينان تبصران ولسان ينطق يقول: وكلت بثلاثة: بكل جبار عنيد وبكل من دعا مع الله إلهاً آخر وبالمصورين\"[7]", "english": "And He (the Prophet) said: \"There will emerge from the Fire a neck having two ears that hear and two eyes that see and a tongue that speaks, saying: I have been entrusted with three: with every arrogant obstinate one and with everyone who calls upon with Allah another god and with the image-makers.\"", "book_file": "vol3_Vol3-book-9a.doc.txt", "book_title": "Condemnation of Pride and Conceit", "content_type": "ethics", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on the diseases of the heart and their cure, from 'Condemnation of Pride and Conceit'", "badge": "Ethics"}], "215": [{"arabic": "فالعلم من أعظم ما يتكبر به، ولذلك قال تعالى لنبيه عليه السلام \"واخفض جناحك لمن اتبعك من المؤمنين\" وقال عز وجل \"ولو كنت فظاً غليظ القلب لانفضوا من حولك\" ووصف أولياءه فقال \"أذلة على المؤمنين أعزة على الكافرين\" وكذلك قال ﭬ فيما رواه العباس رضي الله عنه \"يكون قوم يقرؤون القرآن لا يجاور حناجرهم يقولون: قد قرأنا القرآن فمن أقرأ منها ومن أعلم منها\" ثم التفت إلى أصحابه وقال \"أولئك منكم أيها الأمة أولئك هم وقود النار\"[51] ولذلك قال عمر رضي الله عنه لا تكونوا جبابرة العلماء فلا يفي علمكم بجهلكم.", "english": "Knowledge is among the greatest things through which one becomes arrogant, and therefore Allah the Exalted said to His Prophet (peace be upon him): \"And lower your wing (i.e., be humble and gentle) for those who follow you from among the believers (Mu'minin).\" And He the Almighty said: \"And if you had been rude [in speech] and harsh in heart (Qalb), they would have dispersed from around you.\" And He described His allies (Awliya') saying: \"Humble (Adhillah) towards the believers, mighty (A'izzah) towards the disbelievers.\" And likewise, the Prophet (peace be upon him) said in what was narrated by Al-'Abbas (may Allah be pleased with him): \"There will be a people who recite the Quran, it does not go beyond their throats; they say: 'We have recited the Quran, so who is more reciting than us and who is more knowledgeable than us?'\" Then he turned to his companions and said: \"Those are from among you, O Ummah; those are the fuel of the Fire.\" [51] And therefore, 'Umar (may Allah be pleased with him) said: \"Do not be tyrants (Jababirah) of the scholars, lest your knowledge not suffice against your ignorance.\"", "book_file": "vol3_Vol3-book-9a.doc.txt", "book_title": "Condemnation of Pride and Conceit", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Condemnation of Pride and Conceit'", "badge": "Insight"}, {"arabic": "ولو كان الله سبحانه وتعالى يرضى لك ذلك لما قال لنبيه ﷺ 'واخفض جناحك لمن اتبعك من المؤمنين' وهؤلاء الذين يظهر أثر الكبر على شمائلهم فأحوالهم أخف حالاً ممن هو في الرتبة الثالثة وهو الذي يظهر الكبر على لسانه حتى يدعوه إلى الدعوى والمفاخرة والمباهاة وتزكية النفس وحكايات الأحوال والمقامات والتشمر لغلبة الغير في العلم والعمل.", "english": "And if Allah, the Exalted and Glorified, were pleased with that for you, He would not have said to His Prophet (peace be upon him): 'And lower your wing (i.e., show humility and gentleness) for those who follow you from among the believers.' And these are those upon whose outward demeanor the effect of arrogance appears, so their condition is lighter than the one in the third rank, who is the one who manifests arrogance upon his tongue until it calls him to claim, boasting, vainglory, self-purification (Tazkiyah al-Nafs), narrations of states (Ahwal) and stations (Maqamat), and striving to overcome others in knowledge and action.", "book_file": "vol3_Vol3-book-9a.doc.txt", "book_title": "Condemnation of Pride and Conceit", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Condemnation of Pride and Conceit'", "badge": "Insight"}], "216": [{"arabic": "وهذا التحقيق وهو أن الصداقة لحمة كلحمة النسب و القريب لا يجوز أن يهجر بالمعصية ولذلك قال الله تعالى لنبيه صلى الله عليه وسلم في عشيرته فإن عصوك فقل إني بريء مما تعملون ولم يقل أني بريء منكم مراعاة لحق القرابة ولحمة النسب", "english": "And this verification is that friendship is a bond like the bond of kinship, and the relative should not be abandoned due to sin. Therefore, Allah the Exalted said to His Prophet (peace be upon him) regarding his kin: 'If they disobey you, then say: Indeed, I am innocent of what you do.' And He did not say: 'I am innocent of you,' out of consideration for the right of kinship and the bond of lineage.", "book_file": "vol2_j2-k05.doc.txt", "book_title": "Duties of Brotherhood", "content_type": "general", "topic": "Commentary from Al-Ghazali's Ihya 'Ulum al-Din, from 'Duties of Brotherhood'", "badge": "General"}], "218": [{"arabic": "وقال عكرمة في قوله عز وجل: ﴿ الذي يراك حين تقوم وتقلبك في الساجدين ﴾ قال قيامه وركوعه وسجوده وجلوسه. وأما الركوع والسجود فينبغي أن تجدد عندهما ذكر كبرياء الله سبحانه وترفع يديك مستجيرا بعفو الله عز وجل من عقابه بتجديد نية ومتبعا سنة نبيه ﭬ ثم تستأنف له ذلا وتواضعا بركوعك وتجتهد في ترقيق قلبك وتجديد خشوعك وتستشعر ذلك وعز مولاك واتضاعك وعلو ربك وتستعين على تقرير ذلك في قلبك بلسانك فتسبح ربك وتشهد له بالعظمة وأنه أعظم من كل عظيم وتكرر ذلك على قلبك لتؤكده بالتكرار ثم ترتفع من ركوعك راجيا أنه راحم لك", "english": "And 'Ikrimah said regarding His Exalted statement: 'The One Who sees you when you stand and your turning among those who prostrate' (Quran 26:218-219), he said: 'His standing, bowing, prostration, and sitting.' As for the bowing and prostration, you should renew at them the remembrance (Dhikr) of the greatness of Allah, the Exalted, and raise your hands seeking refuge in the forgiveness of Allah, the Exalted, from His punishment by renewing intention and following the tradition (Sunnah) of His Prophet (peace be upon him). Then you begin for Him with humility and submission in your bowing, and strive to soften your heart (Qalb) and renew your reverence (Khushu'), and feel that and the might of your Master and your lowliness and the loftiness of your Lord, and you seek help in affirming that in your heart (Qalb) with your tongue, so you glorify your Lord and testify to Him of greatness and that He is greater than every great one, and you repeat that upon your heart (Qalb) to confirm it with repetition. Then you rise from your bowing hoping that He is merciful to you and confirming the hope in yourself by saying: 'Allah hears the one who praises Him,' meaning He responds to the one who thanks Him. Then you follow that thanks which demands increase, so you say: 'Our Lord, to You is praise,' and increase the praise by saying: 'As much as fills the heavens and the earth.' Then you descend to the prostration, which is the highest degrees of submission, so you place the noblest of your limbs, which is the face, upon the lowliest of things, which is the dust. And if it is possible for you not to place a barrier between them, so prostrate on the ground, then do so, for it is more conducive to reverence (Khushu') and more indicative of humility. And when you place yourself in the position of humility, know that you have placed it in its place and returned the branch to its origin, for you were created from dust and to it you return. At this, renew upon your heart (Qalb) the greatness of Allah and say: 'Glory be to my Lord, the Most High,' and confirm it with repetition, for the repetition...", "book_file": "vol1_Vol1-book-4.doc.txt", "book_title": "Mysteries of Prayer", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Mysteries of Prayer'", "badge": "Insight"}, {"arabic": "فأنشأ يقول صغير هواك عذبني فكيف به إذا احتنكا وأنت جمعت في قلبي هوى قد كان مشتركا أما ترثى لمكتئب إذا ضحك الخلى بكى فقام ذو النون وسقط على وجهه ثم قام رجل آخر فقال ذو النون الذي يراك حين تقوم فجلس ذلك الرجل وكان ذلك اطلاعا من ذي النون على قلبه أنه متكلف متواجد فعرفه أن الذي يراه حين يقوم هو الخصم في قيامه لغير الله تعالى ولو كان الرجل صادقا لما جلس", "english": "He began to say: 'Small was your love, it tormented me, so how about when it becomes intense? And you have gathered in my heart (Qalb) a love that was shared. Do you not have mercy on a depressed one when the empty one laughs, he cries?' Then Dhu al-Nun stood up and fell on his face. Then another man stood up and said: 'Dhu al-Nun, the One Who sees you when you stand (Qiyam).' That man sat down, and that was an unveiling (Ittila') from Dhu al-Nun upon his heart (Qalb) that he was pretentious and affected. So he made him know that the One Who sees him when he stands (Qiyam) is the adversary in his standing (Qiyam) for other than Allah the Exalted. And if the man had been truthful, he would not have sat down.", "book_file": "vol2_j2-k08.doc.txt", "book_title": "Audition and Ecstasy", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Audition and Ecstasy'", "badge": "Insight"}, {"arabic": "فإذا خطرت فعلاجها أن يتذكر أن الناس لو عرفوا نفاقه في الباطن واطلعوا على ضميره لمقتوه، وإن الله مطلع على ضميره وهو له أشد مقتاً، كما روي عن ذي النون رحمه الله أنه قام وزعق، فقام معه شيخ آخر رأى فيه أثر التكلف فقال يا شيخ! الذي يراك حين تقوم؟ فجلس الشيخ وكل ذلك من أعمال المنافقين.", "english": "If these [thoughts] occur, their treatment is to remember that if people knew his hypocrisy in the inner self (Batin) and became aware of his conscience (Damir), they would despise him, and indeed Allah is aware of his conscience (Damir) and He despises him more severely. As narrated about Dhun-Nun, may Allah have mercy on him, that he stood up and cried out, so another elder stood up with him who saw in him the effect of affectation (Takalluf) and said: O elder! The One Who sees you when you stand? So the elder sat down, and all of that is from the deeds of the hypocrites (Munafiqun).", "book_file": "vol3_Vol3-book-8a.doc.txt", "book_title": "Condemnation of Status and Ostentation", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Condemnation of Status and Ostentation'", "badge": "Insight"}], "224": [{"arabic": "وأما الأشعار فتكثيرها في المواعظ مذموم قال الله تعالى والشعراء يتبعهم الغاوون ألم تر أنهم في كل واد يهيمون وقال تعالى وما علمناه الشعر وما ينبغي له وأكثر ما اعتاده الوعاظ من الأشعار ما يتعلق بالتواصف في العشق وجمال المعشوق وروح الوصال وألم الفراق والمجلس لا يحوى إلا أجلاف العوام وبواطنهم مشحونة بالشهوات وقلوبهم غير منفكة عن الالتفات إلى الصور المليحة فلا تحرك الأشعار من قلوبهم إلا ما هو مستكن فيها فتشتعل فيها نيران الشهوات فيزعقون ويتواجدون وأكثر ذلك أو كله يرجع إلى نوع فساد فلا ينبغي أن يستعمل ", "english": "As for poetry, its abundance in admonitions is blameworthy. Allah the Exalted said: 'And the poets - the deviators follow them; Do you not see that in every valley they wander?' (Quran 26:224-225) And He said: 'And We did not teach him poetry, nor is it befitting for him.' (Quran 36:69) Most of what preachers have accustomed themselves to from poetry relates to mutual description in passionate love (al-'ishq) and the beauty of the beloved and the spirit (ruh) of union and the pain of separation. The gathering contains only the coarse common people, and their inner selves (bawatin) are filled with lusts, and their hearts (qulub) are not detached from turning attention to beautiful images. So poetry does not stir from their hearts except what lies hidden within them, thus igniting in them the fires of lusts, so they cry out and experience ecstatic states. Most or all of that returns to a type of corruption. So it is not appropriate to use from poetry except what contains admonition or wisdom on the basis of citation and familiarity. And the Prophet (peace be upon him) said: 'Indeed, in poetry there is wisdom.'", "book_file": "vol1_Vol1-book-1.doc.txt", "book_title": "Book of Knowledge", "content_type": "spiritual", "topic": "Al-Ghazali's insights on the inner dimensions of faith, from 'Book of Knowledge'", "badge": "Insight"}]}, "wordTiming": {"abdulbasit": {"1": [[1, 350, 6480]], "2": [[1, 350, 887], [2, 887, 1926], [3, 1926, 2803], [4, 2803, 3842]], "3": [[1, 350, 1357], [2, 1357, 2151], [3, 2151, 3280], [4, 3280, 4206], [5, 4206, 5854], [6, 5854, 7238]], "4": [[1, 400, 862], [2, 862, 1880], [3, 1880, 2877], [4, 2877, 4052], [5, 4052, 4776], [6, 4776, 6704], [7, 6704, 7690], [8, 7690, 8750], [9, 8750, 10240], [10, 10240, 10975], [11, 10975, 12393]], "5": [[1, 400, 1233], [2, 1233, 2675], [3, 2675, 3376], [4, 3376, 4006], [5, 4006, 4707], [6, 4707, 6078], [7, 6078, 6931], [8, 6931, 7855], [9, 7855, 9216], [10, 9216, 9846], [11, 9846, 11269]], "6": [[1, 400, 1083], [2, 1083, 2474], [3, 2474, 4296], [4, 4296, 5821], [5, 5821, 6336], [6, 6336, 7663], [7, 7663, 8039], [8, 8039, 9780]], "7": [[1, 400, 1337], [2, 1337, 2453], [3, 2453, 3191], [4, 3191, 4148], [5, 4148, 4547], [6, 4547, 5903], [7, 5903, 6900], [8, 6900, 7299], [9, 7299, 7847], [10, 7847, 8545], [11, 8545, 9441]], "8": [[1, 400, 1178], [2, 1178, 1711], [3, 1711, 2512], [4, 2512, 3727], [5, 3727, 4601], [6, 4601, 5368], [7, 5368, 6689], [8, 6689, 8448]], "9": [[1, 350, 1367], [2, 1367, 2108], [3, 2108, 2780], [4, 2780, 3965], [5, 3965, 5278]], "10": [[1, 350, 980], [2, 980, 1975], [3, 1975, 2597], [4, 2597, 3840], [5, 3840, 4205], [6, 4205, 4636], [7, 4636, 5465], [8, 5465, 7029]], "11": [[1, 350, 1193], [2, 1193, 2491], [3, 2491, 3356], [4, 3356, 4939]], "12": [[1, 400, 1344], [2, 1344, 2027], [3, 2027, 3903], [4, 3903, 5121], [5, 5121, 5668], [6, 5668, 7638]], 